<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">YOWANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu Wumbote wu Yoane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu wumbote wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowane</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni Musamu wumbote wusonika ntumwa Yoane. Yoane wuna zonzila mu buuku bedi misamu mihidika Yesu ha luse lu butoto bebubu, mi kalonga ku bantu, lufwa lwandi na mfulukulu andi mu bafwa. Yesu wuna longa bantu mu kibakala, wuna nyakisa zimbevo, wuna kuma mpeve zimbi, mpe wuna hidika misamu mimingi midi mingitukulu ku bantu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buuku bedidi disonika Yoane ditomeni fwanakana bubwingi ko na di Matayi, di Malako na di Luka. Bulendi ba ti Yoane wubanza ti yobobo ba kasonikina buuku bedidi, bazaba mabuuku bemama, na mita Yesu momo na mi kahidika mpe. Ni hahoho, kana zonzila bubwingi ko myo mina ta Matayi, Malako na Luka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoane wuta kuntonono yi buuku bedidi Yesu kadi. Wuta ti yandi ni Mambu ma Nzambi ma yizidi ha luse lu butoto mu ba bonso muntu. Yesu wuhidika misamu mimingi mingitukulu, mwanki bantu bakwikila ti yandi ni Ntinu yi kisoodila Nzambi, muta ti ni yandi waavuukisa bantu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ntangu yi Yesu, bantu baba mu nkabani: mwa ndambu yedi kwikilanga mu Yesu, mu dyambu ti yi kwikila ti yandi ni Mwana Nzambi. Bahiika bamubela, bedi tanga ti yandi muntu wu Satana kadi, wuna vweza Nzambi, mpe fwanakani mu hondo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoane wuta ti: «Misamu misonama mu buuku bedidi, misonoko mwanki lukwikila ti Yesu ni yandi Muvuukisi, Mwana wu Nzambi. Tala ti lukwikidi mu yandi, luna baka moyo mu yandi <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">Yoa 20.31</ref></char>.»</para>
  <para style="iot">Tala bonso budi ndandani yi misamu mu buuku bedidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Masiika ma Mpova (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1.1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Ndongolo yi Yoane Mbotiki (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-34">1.19-34</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Yesu soodidi milongoki myandi mintete (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">1.35-51</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Yesu hidikidi bimangu nsambwadi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2.1–12.50</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Lumingu lumanunu lu Yesu ha luse lu butoto: mfundusu na lufwa lwandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 12:1-19:42">12.1–19.42</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Yesu wufuluka mu bafwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">20.1-10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki myandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:11-21:25">20.11–21.25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Klisto wudi Mpova yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ku mbadukulu, Mpova yikibeela, Mpova yiba ha kimosi na Nzambi, mpe Mpova ni Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Mpova yiba ha kimosi na Nzambi ku mbadukulu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Bimvimba mu Mpova bihidimina. Kunaani kima kilembolo hidimina mu Yandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mu yandi muba luzingu, mpe luzingu belolo luba kya ki bantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Kya kilezima mu kati di tombe, kansi tombe ki mutambula ko. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nzambi wutambika bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Yoane. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Wuyiza bonso mbangi, mu teela kya kimbangi, mwanki bamvimba bakwikila mu kya mu kimbangi kyandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yandi bende kaba kya ko, kansi wuyiza mu teela kya kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Kya bekyokyo kiba nkatika kya kikedika, kiyiza mu nza mu kyenzola bantu bamvimba.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Mpova yiba mu nza mpe nza yihidimina mu yandi, kansi nza yimubakula ko. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Wuyiza kuu bantu bandi, kansi bantu bandi bamutambula ko. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kansi ku bamvimba bamutambudi na bana kwikila mu yandi, wubaheeni lulendo lweba baala ba Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Babutukidi mu nsatu zi nsuni ko hoti mu luzolo lu bakala na mukento ko, kansi mu luzolo lu Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mpova yiyiza ba muntu, yizinga ha kati dyeto, yiba yifuluka mu bumbote na mu kedika. Tuyena nkembo andi, nkembo yi Mwana wakwa wumosi kaka, yikatambudi ku Tata. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yoane wumuteela kimbangi na wubokana ti: «Yandi nedi zonzila bu nedi ta ti: “Muntu wuna kwiza ku manima mani, wumvudidi mfunu, mu dyambu ti teekila meno naba, yandi buna wudi.”» <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Mu bunene bu bubote bwandi, yeto bamvimba tutambudi lusakumunu ha yulu lusakumunu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wutuheeka Misiku mu Mose, kansi bubote na kedika biyizila mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kunaani muntu weka ne yena Nzambi. Kansi Mwana andi wakwa wumosi kaka, wudi Nzambi mpe wukwe zinganga na Tata andi, yandi wu tulonka bwedi Nzambi kadi.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbangi ki Yoane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:1-8">Mal 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Eki ni kimbangi kita Yoane, mu ntangu zinganga-Nzambi na balevita, yobobo batambika zimfumu zi Bayudayo zi mbanza Yelusalemi, mu kwe mufuula ti: «Ngeye, nani wudi e?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Kabisa mu bahaana mvutu ko, kansi ha ntadisi yi bamvimba, wubateela ti: « Meno nidi Klisto ko.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ni bamufuula ti: «Kadi bwabu nani wudi e? Ngeye ni Eliya e?» Yoane wubavutudila ti: «kani, ka meno ko». Bamufuula dyaka ti: «Ngeye mumbikudi wudi e?» Wubavutudila ti: «kani, ka meno ko.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ba bwesa mufuula ti: «Nani wudi e? Tufweti haana mvutu ku yobobo ba tutambikidi. Nki wuna ta mu ngebende e?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yoane wubavutudila ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">« Meno ni yondowo wuna lookana ku nsi yinkatu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">sungikeeno nzila yi Mfumu!» Bonso busamuna wo mumbikudi Yesaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Mu yobobo ba batambika ku Yoane, kuba na Bafalisi, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />bamufuula dyaka ti: «Tala ti wudi Klisto ko, Eliya ko na mumbikudi ko, bwabu nki wuna botikila e?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yoane wubavutudila ti: «Meno nina lubotika mu mamba, kansi kuu na muntu ha kati dyeno, wu lulembolo zaba.» <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Wuna kwiza ku manima mani, kansi niidi wulunga ko mu munyanguna misinga mi nsampatu zandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mimvimba bemyomyo ku mbanza yi Betani myedi hyokila, ku simu di nzadi yi Yolodani, ha kibuka kyedi botikila Yoane.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mwana dimeme di Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Kilumbu kilanda, Yoane wuyena Yesu wedi kwiza ku yandi, ni kata ti: «Taleno Mwana dimeme di Nzambi dikwe katulanga masumu ma nza. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yandi nedi zonzila bu nedi ta ti: “Muntu wuna kwiza ku manima mani, wumvudidi mfunu, mu dyambu ti teekila naba, yandi buna wudi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Meno nedi muzaba ko, kansi nayizidi mu botika mu mamba mwanki namuzabikisa ku kanda di Isaeli.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yoane wuta dyaka kimbangi eki: «Nayeni Mpeve yi Nzambi yina kulumuka tuuka ku yulu mu kifwani ki bembe na dizi tentama ha yulu andi. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Meno nedi muzaba ko, kansi Nzambi wumfidisa mu botika mu mamba, wunteela ti: “Yondowo wu waayena Mpeve yina kulumuka, mpe yina tentama ha yulu andi, yandi kwe botikanga mu Mpeve Yilongo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Meno nayeni mu meso mani, mpe nina ta kimbangi ti, ni yandi Mwana Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milongoki mintete mi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Kilumbu kilanda, Yoane wuba dyaka ha kibuka bekyokyo na myole mu milongoki myandi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Bu kayena Yesu wedi hyoka, ni kata ti: «Taleno Mwana Dimeme di Nzambi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Milongoki mya mimyole bu miyuwa bobo, ni milanda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu bu kabaluka, wuyena ti bana kwiza mulandi, ni kabafuula ti: «Nki luna sosa e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Labi, kwedi kwe zakidilanga e? Mbangudulu yi mpova yi Labi ni Mulongisi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Wubavutudila ti: «Yizeno na mbo luyena.» Bayenda ni bayena ha kakwe zakidilanga, mpe bahyokisa nandi ndambu yi kilumbu bekyokyo. Kampe yiba ngunga yi ya ku manima ma ntangu ha mbata.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andele, mpangi yi Simoni-Petelo, wuba wumosi mu ya babole bayuwa misamu mizonza Yoane na balanda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Muntu wuntete wu kayenda yenikina ni Simoni mpangi andi na wumuteela ti: «Tuyeni Mesiya». Mbangudulu yi "Mesiya" ni "Klisto". <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andele ni kamunata ku Yesu. Yesu bu kamusungimina na swii, ni kamuteela ti: «Ngeye ni Simoni, mwana wu Yoane. Bwabu mu nkumbu yi Sefase bakutumisinanga». Mbangudulu yi "Sefase" ni "Petelo".<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubokila Filipi na Natanayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Kilumbu kilanda, Yesu wubonga nzengolo mu kwenda ku kizunga ki Ngalili. Wubwana Filipi na wumuteela ti: «Ndanda!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipi wuba mwisi-Betesayida, mbanza yi Andele na Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Mboki Filipi wuyenda yena Natanayeli na wumuteela ti: «Tuyeni muntu wuzonzila Mose mu buuku di Misiku mpe wuzonzila ba mimbikudi. Ni Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, mwana wu Yosefi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayeli wumufuula ti: «Ku Nazaleti mpe kulendi totoka dyambu dimbote e?» Filipi wumuvutudila ti: «Yiza na mbo wuyena.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu bu kayena Natanayeli wedi kwiza ku yandi, ni kamuteela ti: «Taleno, ewu nkatika mwisi-Isaeli kwe lembolo hunanga.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayeli wumufuula ti: «Kwedi nzabidi e?» Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Teekila Filipi kakutumisa, nakuyeningi bu bedingi ha nsye muti wu fike.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanayeli ni kamuteela ti: «Mulongisi, ngeye Mwana Nzambi wudi, ngeye Ntinu yi Isaeli wudi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Bu nakuteedidi ti nakuyeningi bu bedingi ha nsye muti wu fike, hahoho kwikidi e? Mbo wuyena misamu mihyokidi kitezo na emi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu wubwesa ta ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, mbo luyena yulu dizibuka na mbazi zi Nzambi zina tomboka na zina kulumuka ha yulu Mwana Muntu.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Makwela ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Kilumbu ki tatu, ku mbanza yi Kaana mu kizunga ki Ngalili, kuba na mukembo wu makwela, mpe ngudi yi Yesu wuba koko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ku mukembo bewowo batumisa mpe Yesu na milongoki myandi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Vinu bu diyiza hwa, ngudi yi Yesu wumuteela ti: «Basidi na vinu ko.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Kansi Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Mama, nkye musamu ngeye na meno e? Ntangu ani yafweni ko.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ngudi andi wuteela bisadi ti: «Sadileeno mimvimba mi kaaluteela.»<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Huma behoho haba na bisiku bisambanu bihiduku mu matadi, byedi sadilanga Bayudayo mu kivedisa. Kisiku kimosi kilendi kota nkama di zilitele zi mamba. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu wuta ku bisadi ti: «Teboleeno bisiku bebyobyo mu mamba.» Ni batebola byo. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Mboki wubateela ti: «Bwabu tekoneeno mamba bemomo na nateeno mo ku muntwadisi wu mukembo.» Ni bamunatina mo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Muntwadisi wu mukembo wubimba mamba makitukidi vinu. Kazaba ko kwedi mafuma, kansi bisadi biteka mamba bazaba. Ni hahoho katumisina kikwedi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />wumuteela ti: «Konso muntu, vinu dimbote kakwe teka kabulanga, mboki bantu bu bamana kolo, wubaheeni vinu dilembolo toma ba dimbote. Kansi ngeye swekidi kwaku vinu dimbote natee ntangu beyiyi!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Bwabobo bu tonina bimangu bi Yesu, mu kimangu ki kasa ku mbanza yi Kaana, mu kizunga ki Ngalili. Wulonkisa nkembo andi, na milongoki myandi mimukwikila.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Mboki wukulumuka ku mbanza yi Kapenawumi ha kimosi na ngudi andi, na mpangi zandi zi babakala, na milongoki myandi. Kansi mwa ndambu yi bilumbu kwandi baba koko.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukuma bantu mu nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mlk 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Mukembo wu Pake wu Bayudayo wuba bela-bela, mpe Yesu wutomboka ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ku nzo-Nzambi wuyena mintekisi mi zingombe, mameme na mabembe, mpe na bantu baba bazakala ha meza mawu bedi hyakisanga mbongo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ni hahoho, kahidikila kikoti mu misinga misyeto ni kedi kwe bakumi bamvimba mu nzo-Nzambi, na mameme na zingombe. Wusangimisa mbongo zi mihyakisi mpe wumwangisa meza mawu, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />na wuta ku mintekisi mi mabembe ti: «Katuleeno bimvimba byo haha, mpe ka lukitulandi nzo yi Tata ani zandu dyeno ko.» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Milongoki myandi mibambuka moyo ti basonika: Vema di luzolo lwani mu dyambu di nzo aku dyaanyengisa bonso tiya.<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Kansi Bayudayo bamufuula ti: «Nkye kidimbu kingitukulu lendi tusila mu tulonka ti, ngeye wuu na luve mu sa bobo e?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bwonzomoneeno nzo-Nzambi beyiyi, mbo nabwesa tunga yo mu bilumbu bitatu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bayudayo bamuteela ti: «Mvula makumi maya na sambanu basa mu tunga nzo-Nzambi beyiyi, bwabu ngeye mu bilumbu bitatu waatedimisa yo e?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kansi nzo-Nzambi yi kedi zonzila ni nitu andi. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ni hahoho, Yesu bu kafuluka mu bafwa, milongoki myandi mibambuka moyo mu misamu mi kata, mpe mikwikila mu Masonama na mu myo mizonza Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zebi mutima wu muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Mu ntangu yiba Yesu ku Yelusalemi ku mukembo wu Pake, babingi bamukwikila bu bedi yena bidimbu bingitukulu bi kedi hidika. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Kansi Yesu kabasila kivuvu ko, mu dyambu ti bamvimba wubazaba, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />na kaba na nsatu ko ti bamuteela bwedi muntu kadi, mu dyambu ti zebi mii ku nsye mutima wu muntu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Mu zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo mu kabu di Bafalisi kuba na bakala dimosi, nkumbu andi Nikodemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Wuyiza tala Yesu mu mpimpa na wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi, tuzebi ti Mulongisi wutambikidi Nzambi wudi, mu dyambu ti kunaani muntu lendi sa bidimbu bingitukulu bi wuna sa tala ti Nzambi kadi mu yandi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika nakuteedidi, tala ti muntu kabutukidi mbutuka yimoona ko, kalendi yena Kimfumu ki Nzambi ko.»<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo wumufuula ti: «Bwedi muntu kalendi butukila dyaka tala ti weka kinunu e? Lenda kota dyaka mu moyo wu ngudi andi, mu butuka nkumbu yi nzole e?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika nakuteedidi, tala ti muntu kabutukidi mu mamba na mu Mpeve ko, kalendi yena Kimfumu ki Nzambi ko. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Wonso wubutukidi mu nsuni, nsuni kadi na wubutukidi mu Mpeve, mpeve kadi. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Kuyitukwandi ko bu nakuteedidi ti: “Lufweti butuka mbutuka yimoona.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mupepe wukwe huhanga konso ku wutidi, wuna yuwa lusuku, kansi zebi ko kwedi wufumini na kwedi wuna tadisa. Ni bwabobo mpe bukwe banga wonso muntu butukidi mu Mpeve.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo wubwesa mufuula ti: «Bwedi bulendi hidimina e?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye mulongisi wudi mu Isaeli, zebi misamu bemimi ko e? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Kedika mu kedika nina kuteela wo, tuna zonzila mi tuzebi, mpe tuna ta kimbangi mu mi tuyeni, kansi yeno luna tambula kimbangi kyeto ko. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Tala ti luna kwikila ko bu nina luzonzila misamu mi ha luse lu butoto, bwabu bwedi lwaakwikila bu naaluzonzila misamu mi ku yulu e? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kunaani muntu wutomboka ku yulu tala ti ka Mwana Muntu kaka ko wukulumukini tuka ku yulu.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Bonso buzangudila Mose nyoka ha yulu muti ku nsi yinkatu, bwabobo mpe Mwana Muntu kafweti zangulu, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />mwanki wonso muntu waamukwikila, waabaka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kadi bonso bwabu Nzambi wutoma zola nza, ni kahaana mwana andi wakwa wumosi kaka, mwanki wonso wuna musila kiminu, kaabungu ko, kansi waabaka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi katambika mwana andi mu nza mu fundisa nza ko, kansi mwanki nza yivuuka mu yandi. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Wonso waamukwikila kaafundusu ko, kansi yondowo waalembolo mukwikila meni kimfudisa, mu dyambu ti kakwikidi mu nkumbu yi Mwana wakwa wumosi kaka wu Nzambi ko. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Mfundusu ebu yidi: kya kizidi mu nza, kansi bantu basodidi kwawu tombe na babisidi kya, mu dyambu ti nsalulu zawu zimbi zidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Wonso muntu kwe sadilanga mambi, katiidi kya ko, mpe fweti tina kya, mwanki nsalulu zandi zimbi zilembolo zabakana kuu bantu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kansi yondowo kwe sadilanga kedika, kwe kwizanga ku kya mwanki mavanga mandi mayenika ti maa madedama na luzolo lu Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yoane mumbotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ku manima, Yesu na milongoki myandi bayenda ku kizunga ki Yuda. Wuzakala nawu koko mwa bilumbu na wedi botikanga bantu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yoane mpe wedi botika bantu ku mbanza yi Ayinoni, bela-bela na mbanza yi Salimi, mu dyambu ti mamba mamingi maba koko. Bantu bedi kwendanga ku Yoane mu botoko. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Mu ntangu beyoyo buna batudidi Yoane mu boloko ko.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Muyudayo wumosi wedi sa mpaka na milongoki mi Yoane mu dyambu di tadidi mvedosolo. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Milongoki miyenda ku Yoane na mimuteela ti: «Mulongisi, yondowo wuba naaku ku simu di nzadi yi Yolodani, wu wuteela kimbangi, yandi mpe wuna botika bantu na bamvimba bana kwenda ku yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yoane wubavutudila ti: «Muntu kalendi tambula kima ko tala ti Nzambi kamuheeni kyo ko.» <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Yeno bende mbangi zani ludi bu nata ti: «Meno nii Klisto ko, kansi meno ni yondowo wubatambikidi ku mutwala andi.» <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Toko di kwedidi yandi vwidi ndumba yi bakwedidi. Kansi nkayi yi toko bedyodyo, bela-bela kakwe banga nandi na kwe muyuwanga, mpe ndinga andi yikwe toma muyangidikanga. Kyese bekyokyo kyani kidi, mpe kilunga bwabu kidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Bika yandi kazangama, na meno nakuluka.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yondowo fumini ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Yondowo fumini ku yulu, hyokidi bamvimba mfunu. Kansi yondowo fumini ha nza, muntu wu nza kadi, nzonzolo andi yi kinza yidi. Yondowo fumini ku yulu, hyokidi bamvimba mfunu, <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />wuna ta kimbangi mu mikayeni na mikayudi, kansi kuu na muntu wuna tambula kimbangi kyandi ko. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yondowo tambudi kimbangi kyandi, singisi ti Nzambi kedika kakwe tanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yondowo Nzambi wukatambikidi, kwe samunanga mambu ma Nzambi, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wumuheeni Mpeve yi hyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tata tiidi Mwana na tuudidi bimvimba mu moko ma Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Wonso kwikidi mu Mwana, tambudi luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Wonso bisidi mu kwikila mu Mwana kaabaka lo ko, kansi nganzi zi Nzambi zaazingila mu yandi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mukento wu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Bafalisi bayuwa ti Yesu wuvudidila Yoane mu kitula bantu baba milongoki na mu botika. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(Mu toma tala, Yesu Yandi bende kabotika muntu ko. Kansi milongoki myandi myedi botikanga.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu bu kayuwa bobo, wusisa kizunga ki Yuda, ni kavutuka kwandi ku kizunga ki Ngalili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mu kwenda ku Ngalili, fweti hyokila mu kizunga ki Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Yesu wutuula ha mbanza yimosi yi Samaliya yi nkumbu Sikali, bela-bela na mfuba yi Yakobi yi kahaana ku mwana andi Yosefi. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hahoho haba bulu di mamba di Yakobi. Yesu wuba nahongolo mu dyambu di nzyetolo, ni kazakala ha ntendo bulu di mamba. Kampe yiba bela-bela na ntangu ha mbata.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mukento wumosi mwisi-Samaliya wuyiza mu teka mamba. Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mpeka mwa mamba na nwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Milongoki myandi miyenda ku mbanza mu kwe sumba bye dya.) <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Kansi mukento wu mwisi-Samaliya wuteela Yesu ti: «Ngeye Muyudayo wudi, bwedi wuna ndombila meno mamba me nwa, meno mwisi-Samaliya e?» (Mu dyambu ti Bayudayo bedi banga kintwadi na bisi-Samaliya ko.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Tala ti zebi munkayulu wu Nzambi, mpe nani wuna kulomba mamba me nwa, nga ngeye fwanakani mu mulomba mo. Yandi keti kuhaana mamba ma kwe haananga luzingu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mukento wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, ngeye wuu na ka kisiku kimosi kye tekila mamba ko, mpe bulu disunda didi. Kwedi lenda bakila mamba bemomo ma kwe haananga luzingu e? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Nganunu ngeye hyokidi tata eto Yakobi, wu tuhaana bulu di mamba bedidi e? Yandi bende ma kanwa, na baala bandi na bibulu byandi» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Wonso muntu nwini mamba bemama, waabwesa ba dyaka na mpwila yi mamba, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />kansi wonso muntu waanwa mamba ma naamuhaana, kaabwesa ba na mpwila yi mamba ko. Mamba ma naamuhaana maakituka mu yandi nto yi luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mukento wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, mpeka mamba bemomo mwanki nalembolo bwesa ba na mpwila yi mamba mpe nabiika mu kwiza tekanga mamba ehaha.»<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Yenda wutumisa mulumi aku mboki vutuka ehaha.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mukento wumuvutudila ti: «Nii na mulumi ko.» Yesu ni kamuteela ti: «Wu kedika teedi ti: “Nii na mulumi ko”, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />mu dyambu ti weka neba na babakala batanu, mpe dyo di naaku bwabu, ka mulumi aku ko. Wu kedika teedi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mukento ni kamuteela ti: «Mfumu, bwabu mbakudi ti mumbikudi wudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Zinkaka zeto ha yulu mulandu bewuwu bedi sambidilanga Nzambi, kansi yeno lukwe singisanga ti ku Yelusalemi kaka ku kibuka ki fwanakani mu sambila Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Nge mukento, nkwikila, ntangu yina kwiza, ka ha yulu mulandu bewuwu ko, hoti ka ku Yelusalemi ko lwaabwesa sambidila Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Yeno lukwe sambilanga Nzambi yi lulembolo zaba, kansi yeto tukwe sambilanga Nzambi yi tuzebi, mu dyambu ti mpulusu yina fuma ku Bayudayo. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kansi ntangu yaafwana, bwabu yifweni, yi minsambidi mi kedika, myaasambila Tata mu Mpeve na mu kedika. Ni minsambidi mibobobo Tata kakwe sosanga. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nzambi Mpeve kadi. Ni hahoho, bamvimba bana musambila, bafweti musambila mu Mpeve na mu kedika.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mukento wumuteela ti: «Nzebi ti Mesiya wu bakwe tumisinanga ti Klisto, waakwiza. Bu kaakwiza, mbo katuteela mimvimba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mesiya, ni meno nina kuzonzisa.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Mu kilokola bekyokyo, milongoki myandi mituula. Miyituku bu bayena Yesu wedi zonza na mukento. Kansi ka mulongoki wumosi kamufuula ko ti «Nki wuna mufuula e?» Hoti «Nkye musamu wuna zonza nandi e?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Mukento wusala sisa sanga di mamba, wuvutuka ku mbanza na wuyadila bantu mpolo ti: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Yizeno lutala bakala di ntedidi mimvimba mi nasiidi. Kampe yandi wuu Mesiya e?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bantu ni batotoka mu mbanza na bayiza ku Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Mu kilokola bekyokyo, milongoki myedi kwamisa Yesu ti: «Dya, Mulongisi!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Kansi wubateela ti: «Meno, nii na bindya bi lulembolo zaba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Milongoki myedi teelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Nganunu muntu wumutwadidi bindya e?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Bindya byani, ni mu sadila luzolo lu yondowo wu mfidisi na mu lungisa kisalu ki kantuma mu sala.» <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Kadi lukwe tanga ko ti: «Ngonda ziya kwandi zisiidi, buna ntangu yi nyonzokolo yifweni e?» Kansi nalutedidi ti: sendoleeno meso na taleno zimfuba, mbutu bwabu ziyedidi na zifweni mu yonzika. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Kiyonziki ki mbutu tambudi bwabu mufutu andi, mboki wuna yonzika mbutu zi luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, mwanki kikuni na kiyonziki bayangalala ha kimosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kingana bekiki kikedika kidi: «Wumosi wuna kuna, na wuhiika wuna yonzika.» <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Meno, nalutambikidi mu kwe yonzika bi lulembolo yenina mpasi mu sala. Bahiika basedi, kansi yeno lubeki ndandu yi kisalu kyawu.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Mu dyambu di kimbangi ki mukento bu kata ti: «Ntedidi mimvimba mi nasiidi», bisi-Samaliya babingi ba mbanza beyoyo bakwikila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ni hahoho, bisi-Samaliya bu batula ha ntadisi andi bamubombidila kazakala nawu. Ni kazakala nawu bilumbu byole hoho. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Babingi dyaka bakwikila Yesu mu dyambu di misamu mi kedi ta yandi bende, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />mpe ni bedi ta ku mukento ti: «Tukwikidi mu dyambu di mi teedi kaka ko, kansi yeto bende tumuyudi, mpe tuzebi ti kedika, yandi ni Muvuukisi wu nza.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mwana wu kisadi ki ntinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ku manima ma bilumbu byole, Yesu wukatuka hoho na wuyenda ku kizunga ki Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yandi bende wuta ti: «Mumbikudi kazitusungu mu nsi andi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Bu katula ku kizunga ki Ngalili, bisi-Ngalili bamutambula bumbote. Mu dyambu ti bayena mimvimba mi hidika Yesu ku Yelusalemi ku mukembo wu Pake. Yawu mpe ko baba.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu wuvutuka ku mbanza yi Kaana ku kizunga ki Ngalili ku kakitudila mamba vinu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:46">Ku mbanza Kapenawumi kuba na kisadi kimosi ki ntinu, mwana andi wuba na kimbevo. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Bu kayuwa ti Yesu katukidi ku Yuda tudidi ku kizunga ki Ngalili, wuyenda mu yena na wumubombidila kenda kanyakisa mwana andi wu bakala wu ba bela-bela mu fwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Tala ti luyeni bidimbu na bimangu bingitukulu ko, lulendi kwikila ko e?» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kisadi ki ntinu wumuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, yiza munswalu teekila mwana ani kafwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Vutuka ku nzo aku, mwana aku wumoyo kadi!» Bakala bedyodyo dikwikila myo mi muteela Yesu, ni kavutuka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Bu kedi vutuka, bisadi byandi biyiza mubwana na bimuteela ti: «Mwana aku wumoyo kadi!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Wubafuula mu nkye ntangu kanyakini, bamuvutudila ti: «Mazono mu kilokola kintete ku manima ma ntangu ha mbata, yuku-yuku di mudyemi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tata ni kabakula ti Yesu ni mu kilokola bekyokyo kamuteela ti: «Mwana aku wumoyo kadi.» Buna yandi na kanda dyandi bakwikila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Kyo ni kidimbu kinzole kingitukulu ki sa Yesu ku kizunga ki Ngalili bu kafuma ku kizunga ki Yuda.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wu ba na mbwolokoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ku manima, Yesu wutomboka ku Yelusalemi ku mukembo wumosi wu Bayudayo. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ku Yelusalemi, bela-bela na mwelo wu Mameme, kuba na kizinga ki mamba ki bakwe tumisinanga mu ndinga yi kihebeleo ti Betezata. Kuba na misampa mitanu miba na makunzi mamala. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ku nsye misampa bemyomyo, mbevo zizingi ziba zilambalala: zimpofo, baa na byeta, baa na mbwolokoto. [Bedi kingilanga ti mamba maningana, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />mu dyambu ti ntangu zihiika mbazi yimosi yi Mfumu yedi kulumukanga ha kizinga na yedi ningisanga mamba. Ku manima ma ningusunu yi mamba, mbevo yintete yedi kulumukanga mamba, yedi nyakanga mu kyonso kimbevo ki nandi.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Bakala dimosi diba hoho, diba na kimbevo ki mbwolokoto tuuka mvula makumatatu na nana. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu bu kamuyena wu lambalala na bu kazaba ti tuuka ntama kaa hoho, ni kamufuula ti: «Tiidi wunyaka e?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mbevo ni kamuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, nii na muntu waantuba mu kizinga ko mu ntangu yikwe ningananga mamba, bu nasosa mu kulumuka momo, muntu wukaka wuntekididi.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Telama, bonga nkwala aku na yenda dyati!» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mpe bakala ditumbu nyaka. Wubonga nkwala andi na wutona mu kwe yendi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Kilumbu bekyokyo ki saba kiba. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Mfumu zi Bayudayo ziteela muntu bewowo wu nyaka ti: «Bubedidi kilumbu ki saba kidi, wu na luve ko mu nata nkwala aku.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Wubavutudila ti: «Yondowo wu nyakisi, yandi wu ntedidi ti: “Bonga nkwala aku na yenda dyati!”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bamufuula ti: «Nkye muntu wukuteedidi ti: “Bonga nkwala aku na yenda dyati!” E?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kansi muntu bewowo wu kanyakisa, kazaba ko nani wuba, mu dyambu ti Yesu wuzimbala ha kati di mpumbu yi bantu yi ba hoho.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ku manima ma mwa ntangu, Yesu wumubwana mu kati di nzo-Nzambi na wumuteela ti: «Nyeki bwabu, kubwesandi sumuka ko mwanki dyambu dihyokidi kitezo dilembolo kutudila.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Muntu bewowo wuyenda teela mfumu zi Bayudayo ti ni Yesu wu munyakisa. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ni hahoho Bayudayo batona mu mukwamisa mu dyambu ti wunyakisa mu kilumbu ki saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Kansi Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Tata ani wuna sala natee ntangu beyiyi, meno mpe nina sala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Bayudayo bu bayuwa bobo, basosa bwedi bwe muhondisila mu dyambu ti kavumina musiku wu saba ko, mpe wuta ti Nzambi ni nkatika Tata dyandi, na wukifwanikisa ti kidede badi na Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lulendo lu Mwana Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu wubwesa bateela dyaka ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, Mwana kalendi hidika dyambu mu lutumu lu yandi bende ko, kansi di kayeni dina hidika Tata, dyadyodyo mpe kaahidika. Mu dyambu ti, mimvimba mikwe hidikanga Tata, myamyomyo mpe Mwana kakwe hidikanga.» <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Mu dyambu ti Tata tiidi Mwana na kwe mulonkanga mimvimba mi kakwe hidikanga yandi bende. Mbo kamulonka bisalu bivudidi dyaka bunene, mwanki luyituku. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Bonso Tata kakwe fulukisanga bafwa na kwe bahaananga luzingu, bwabobo mpe Mwana kakwe haananga luzingu ku wonso muntu wu katiidi. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Mpe, Tata kafundisanga muntu ko, kansi wuheeni lulendo lumvimba lwe fundisila ku Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />mwanki bamvimba bazitisa Mwana bonso bu bakwe zitisilanga Tata. Yondowo wa lembolo zitisa Mwana, kazitisi Tata di mufidisi ko.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, wonso muntu wuna yuwa mambu mani na kwikidi yondowo wu ntambikidi, beki luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Yandi kaabedoso ko, kansi katukidi ku lufwa na weka ku luzingu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, kilokola kyefwana, bwabu kifweni, bafwa ki bayuwa ndinga yi Mwana Nzambi, mboki yobobo baayuwa yo baazinga. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Mu dyambu ti Tata bu kaa na luzingu mu yandi bende, bwabobo mpe kahaanina ku Mwana kaba na luzingu mu yandi bende. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Wumuheeni lulendo lwe fundisa mu dyambu ti yandi wudi Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Luyitukwandi mu mimi ko, mu dyambu ti ntangu yina fwana ya yuha yobobo badi mu zindyamu, mu yuwa ndinga andi, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />mpe baatotuka mu zindyamu. Yobobo basadidi mambote bafulukulu mu tambula luzingu. Kansi yobobo basadidi mambi baafuluka mu tambula mfundusu.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Meno nalendi hidika dyambu mu lutumu lu meno bende ko. Meno nkwe fundisanga bonso bunteedidi Tata, mpe mfundusu ani yimbote yidi, mu dyambu ti nalendi sadila luzolo lwani ko, kansi lu yondowo wu mfidisi.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbangi mu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Tala ti nteedi kimbangi mu meno bende, kimbangi kyani kilendi ba kikedika ko. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Kansi muntu wuhiika wuna nteela kimbangi, mpe nzebi ti kimbangi kyandi mu meno kikedika kidi. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Yeno lutambika bantu ku Yoane, yandi wuteela kedika kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Meno nii na nsatu ko ti muntu kanteela kimbangi, kansi nzonzidi bobo, mwanki yeno lubaka mpulusu. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yoane wuba bonso mwinda wu banamikini na wuna kyenzola, yeno mpe lutambula mu yangalala mu kya kwandi, mu mwa ntangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Meno nii na kimbangi kihyokidi bunene na ki Yoane: bisalu bi nina sala, byo bimpana Tata mu lungisa, bina nteela kimbangi na bina lonka ti Tata wu mfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Mpe Tata wu mfidisi, wunteedidi yandi bende kimbangi. Kansi yeno lwayudi ndinga andi ko na lwayeni kini kyandi ko. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Mpe lukwe kebanba mambu mandi ko, mu dyambu ti luna kwikila mu yondowo wu kafidisi ko. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Lukwe fyongoninanga Masonama mu dyambu ti mu mabanza meno, mwamomo lwaabakila luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Nkyongono ni mamomo ma kwe nteelanga kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Kansi lutiidi mu kwiza ku meno ko mu lubaka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Nalombidi ko ti bantu bansiika. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Kansi naluzebi, luu na luzolo lu Nzambi mu yeno ko. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nayizidi mu nkumbu yi Tata ani, na lubisidi mu ntambula. Kansi ti muntu wuhiika wizidi mu nkumbu yi yandi bende, yandi lwaatambula. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Yeno lutiidi mu heekasananga masiika yeno na yeno, kansi lusosangeno ko masiika ma kwe fumanga ku Nzambi yii kwa yimosi, bwedi lulendi kwikila e?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Lubanzandi ko ti meno naalufuunda ku Nzambi. Mumfundi eno ni Mose wu lusididi kivuvu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Mu dyambu ti, tala ti lukwikila Mose, nganunu lunkwikidi meno mpe, mu dyambu ti meno kazonzila mu masonama mandi. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Kansi ti luna kwikila mu ma kasonika ko, bwedi lulendi kwikila mu mi nina zonza e?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mafunda matanu ma babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenda ku kumu dihiika di dyanga di Ngalili di bakwe tumisinanga dyaka ti dyanga di Tibelyade. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mpumbu yi yinene yi bantu yimulanda mu dyambu ti bayena bidimbu bingitukulu bikedi hidika bu kanyakisa zimbevo. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu wutomboka ha yulu mulandu na wuzakala koko na milongoki myandi. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Mukembo wu Pake wu Bayudayo wuba bela-bela.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu wusendola meso na wuyena mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yedi kwiza ku yandi. Wufuula Filipi ti: «Kwedi tulendi sumbila mampa mwanki bantu bebaba badya e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Kedi zonzila bobo mu tala Filipi ka bwedi kaata, mpeleko wuzaba yandi bende nki kedi banza mu sa. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipi wumuvutudila ti: «Kaati mampa ma nkama zole zi mbongo zi bisengo twaasumba, maabalungila ko mpe kani muntu kaabaka mwa kibuku ko.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Wumosi mu milongoki myandi, nkumbu andi Andele mpangi yi Simoni-Petelo, wumuteela ti: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Mwana wu bakala wumosi wu haha wuu na mampa matanu ma <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oloze: mbutu zi bonso mbutu zi bele zi bakwe sadilanga faline</char></note>oloze na mbizi zole. Kansi nki bilenda sa mu mpumbu yi bantu yi bububu e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu ni kata bwabu ti: «Bazakikeeno.» Ni bazakala, mwa bititi bibingi biba ha kibuka bekyokyo. Baba mafunda matanu ma babakala. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu wubonga mampa, bu kavutula matondo ku Nzambi, ni kakabula mo ku yobobo baba hoho. Wusa bumosi mpe mu zimbizi, wubahaana zo bonso bubela nsatu yi muntu-muntu. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bu bamana yukuta, Yesu wuteela milongoki myandi ti: «Toteeno bibuku bisadidi mwanki kani kimosi kifukilandi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bamvimba bu bamana dya, batota byo na batebola mikuta kumi na myole mi bibuku bi sadila bimampa matanu ma oloze. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Bu bayena kidimbu (kimangu) kingitukulu ki sa Yesu, bantu bata ti: «Yandi nkatika ni mumbikudi wu fwanakani mu kwiza mu nza.» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu bu kabakula ti bantu basaka kwiza mu bonga mu kingolo mwanki bamutuula ntinu, wutomboka dyaka yandi hiika ha yulu mulandu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudyata ha mukanda mamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nkokila bu yitula, milongoki mi Yesu mikulumuka ha kumu di dyanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Bakota mu mulungu wumosi na bayendisa ku Kapenawumi ku simu dikaka di dyanga. Mpimpa bu yitula na Yesu kaba ntete kintwadi nawu ko. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Kitembo kimosi kingolo kikukula mpe mamba ma dyanga manangumuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bu bayenda mu mamba kitini makumatanu hoti makumasambanu mankama ma zimetele, bayena Yesu wuna finama ha mulungu, buna wuna kwe dyati ha mukanda mamba. Bayena bunkuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Luyenandi bunkuta ko, meno kwani!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Baba na mayindu me mukotisa mu mulungu, kansi mulungu wutumbu tula ha kumu di bayendisa.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Kilumbu kilanda, mpumbu yi bantu yi saala ku simu dihiika di dyanga, yibakula ti mulungu wumosi kwandi wuba hoho mpe Yesu kamaka na milongoki myandi mu mulungu bewowo ko. Kansi yawu kaka bayenda. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Milungu mihiika mifuma ku mbanza yi Tibelyade, mitula bela-bela na kibuka ki badiila mampa ku manima ma mvutululu yi matondo ma Mfumu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Mpumbu yi bantu bu yiyena ti Yesu na milongoki myandi baba hoho ko, bantu ni bakota yawu bende mu milungu na bayenda ku mbanza yi Kapenawumi mu kwe sosi Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni dimpa di moyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bu bamuyena ku simu dihiika di dyanga, ni bamufuula ti: «Mulongisi, nkye ntangu tudidingi ekuku e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, ka mu dyambu di bimangu bingitukulu bi nasidi luna kwe nsosidi, kansi mu dyambu di mampa ma ludidi na ma luyukuti. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Lusalandi mu dyambu di bindya bikwe fukilanga (bolanga) ko, kansi saleno mu dyambu di bindya bikwe zingilanga mimvu ka mimvu, Mwana Muntu waaluhaana byo, mu dyambu ti Tata Nzambi, wutuula mu yandi kidimbu kyandi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bamufuula bwabu ti: «Nki tufweti sa mu sala bisalu bi Nzambi e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kisalu ki Nzambi ni mu kwikila yondowo wu kafidisi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bamufuula dyaka ti: «Nkye kidimbu kingitukulu lenda tulonka mwanki tukukwikila e? Na nki waasa e? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bankaka zeto badya bindya biba kwe tumisinanga ti mane ku nsi yinkatu badya, bonso budi busonama ti: “Wubahaana mu dya dimpa di fuma ku yulu.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, ka Mose ko wuluhaana dimpa di fuma ku yulu, kansi ni Tata ani kwe wuna luhaana dimpa dikedika di fumini ku yulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Mu dyambu ti dimpa di Nzambi, ni dyadyodyo di fumini ku yulu na dikwe haananga luzingu ku nza.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bamuteela bwabu ti: «Mfumu, tuhaananga ntangu zimvimba dimpa bedyodyo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Meno nii dimpa di moyo, wonso muntu waakwiza kuu meno, kabwesa yena nsatu ko, mboki yondowo waankwikila, kabwesa baka mpwila yi mamba ko.<verse eid="JHN 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kansi wa nalutedidi ti: lunyeni, kansi luna kwikila ko. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Yobobo bamvimba bampeeni Tata, baakwiza ku meno, mpe naabisa yondowo waakwiza ku meno ko, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kadi nafumini ku yulu mu kwiza sadila luzolo lwani ko, kansi lu yondowo wu mfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Luzolo lu yondowo wu mfidisi ludi ti: Nazimbisandi ka wumosi mu yobobo bakampeeni ko, kansi mu kilumbu kinsukunu, na bafulukisa mu bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ninga, luzolo lu Tata ani ludi ti wonso muntu yeni Mwana na kwikidi mu yandi, ka tambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, mpe meno mbo namufulukisa mu bafwa kilumbu ki nsukunu.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bayudayo batona mu nyungutila Yesu mu dyambu wuta ti: «Nii dimpa di fumini ku yulu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bata ti: «Ka ni yandi ko Yesu mwana wu Yosefi e? Nganunu tuzebi tata na ngudi andi ko e? Bwedi kalendi teedila bwabu ti: “ku yulu na fumini e?”» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bikeno mu nyunguta yeno na yeno. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kunani muntu lenda kwiza ku meno tala ti Tata wumfidisi kamutwadisi ko, mpe meno mbo namufulukisa mu bafwa kilumbu kinsukunu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Wusonama mu mabuku ma mimbikudi ti: “Bamvimba baatambula ndongosolo ku Nzambi.” Wonso muntu yudi miteedi Tata na tambudi ndongosolo andi, wuna kwiza ku meno.» <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Kunani muntu wuyena Tata, tala ti kayondo ko wu fumini ku Nzambi, yandi wuyena Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, wonso muntu kwikidi, beki luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Meno nidi dimpa di moyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bankaka zeno badya bindya bi bakwe tumisinanga ti mane ku nsi yinkatu, kansi bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Kansi, bonso budi dimpa di fumini ku yulu, wonso waadya dyo, kaafwa ko. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />«Ni Meno nidi dimpa di moyo di fumini ku yulu. Wonso muntu waadya dimpa bedyodyo waazinga ntangu zimvimba. Dimpa bedyodyo di naahaana ni nitu ani, mwanki nza yi baka luzingu.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Bayudayo ni batona mu sa mpaka yawu na yawu na bata ti: «Bwedi yandi kalendi tuhaanina nitu andi mu dya e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, tala ti ludidi nitu yi Mwana Muntu ko nalunwini menga mandi ko, lwaaba na luzingu lu kedika ko. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Wonso muntu waadya nitu ani na waanwa menga mani, waatambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, mpe meno naamufulukisa mu bafwa kilumbu kinsukunu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Mu dyambu ti nitu ani nkatika bindya bi kedika bidi mpe menga mani nkatika malamu ma kedika madi. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Wonso muntu waadya nitu ani mpe waanwa menga mani waaba nani kintwadi mu meno, na meno naaba nandi kintwadi. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tata wu mfidisi wumoyo kadi mpe meno nkwe zinganga mu yandi, bwabobo mpe wonso waandya waazinga mu meno. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Di ni dimpa di fumini ku yulu. Diswasana na didya bankaka zeno, kansi yawu bafwa. Kansi wonso muntu waadya dimpa bedidi, waazinga ntangu zimvimba.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu mu ta misamu bemyomyo bu kedi longa mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo ku mbanza Kapenawumi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu makwe haananga luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Bu bamana mu yuwa, milongoki myandi mimingi mi zonza ti: «Mambu mandi ngolo madi! Nani lenda tambula mo e?»<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu wuzaba ti milongoki myandi myedi nyungutilanga misamu bemyomyo, ni hahoho kabafuudila ti: «Bwedi, mpasi mina luyenisi e? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Bwedi lwaata tala ti luyeni Mwana Muntu wuna kwenda ku kedi teka zakidilanga e? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ni Mpeve yi Nzambi yikwe haananga luzingu. Muntu kalendi sa kima ko. Mambu ma na luteedidi, madi Mpeve na luzingu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kansi mwa ndambu bantu ha kati dyeno bana lembolo kwikila.» Yesu wuzaba tuka ku ntonono banani bana lembolo kwikila mpe yondowo waamuyekola. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Wubwesa ta ti: «Ni hahoho nalutedidi ti: Kunaani muntu lenda kwiza ku meno tala ti Tata ani kamuheeni luve belolo ko.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Tuka ntangu beyoyo, milongoki myandi mimingi misala musisa na mibika mu kwe yendi nandi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Buna Yesu wufuula milongoki myandi kumi na myole ti: «Hambo bwabu yeno, lutidi mu kwenda ko e?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petelo wumuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, ku naani twaakwenda e? Ngeye wuu na mambu makwe haananga luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Yeto tu kwikidi na tuzebi ti ngeye Walongo wu Nzambi wudi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Yeno kumi na bole ka meno nalusodidi e? Mpeleko ha kati dyeno wumosi wu nkadyampemba.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yuda, mwana wu Simoni Isikalyoti, kedi zonzila bobo, mu dyambu ti yandi waamuyekola, mpeleko wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole kadi.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku mukembo wu mileba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ku manima, Yesu wutatamana nzyetolo andi mu kizunga ki Ngalili, kansi wubisa mu zyeta mu kizunga ki Yuda mu dyambu ti zimfumu zi Bayudayo zedi sosa mu muhondisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Mukembo wu nzo zi Mileba wu Bayudayo wuba bela-bela, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />mpe zimpangi zi Yesu zimuteela ti: «Katuka haha na yenda ku kizunga ki Yuda, mwanki milongoki myaku miyena yawu mpe misamu mi wuna hidika.» <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kunani muntu kwe sadilanga mu mansweki tala ti tiidi mu zabakana ku bantu bamvimba. Bu wuna hidika misamu mi bobo, kizabikisa bwabu ku bantu. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Mpangi zandi mpe zedi mukwikila ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu ni kabateela ti: «Ntangu ani yafweni ko. Kansi, ku yeno, kadi ntangu yimbote yikwe banga.» <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Nza yilendi lubela ko, kansi meno yena mbela, mu dyambu ti nina ta kimbangi mu mavanga mandi mambi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Yeno tombokeeno ku mukembo. Meno natomboka ani ko, mu dyambu ti ntangu ani yafweni ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu bu kamana ta bobo, wusaala ku kizunga ki Ngalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Kansi zimpangi zandi bu ziyenda ku mukembo wu nzo zi Mileba, Yesu mpe ni kayenda mu mansweki, kansi kakiyenikisa ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Zimfumu zi Bayudayo zi musosa mu ntangu yi mukembo, ni bafuula ti: «Bwabu kwedi kadi e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mu kati di mpumbu yi bantu, banyunguta mu nkumbu andi. Mwa ndambu yi bantu bata ti: «Muntu wumbote wudi.» Bakaka babisa ti: «Kaani, wuna zimbisa bantu.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kansi nakani muntu wuzonzila nkumbu andi ha meso ma bantu, mu dyambu ti bamvimba bedi yena bunkuta bu zimfumu zi Bayudayo.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mukembo bu wuba kati-kati Yesu wutomboka ku nzo-Nzambi, na wutona mu longa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bayudayo bayituku na bedi kifuulanga ti: «Bwedi kazabidi Masonama, yandi wulembolo longoka e?»<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Ndongosolo yi nina haana yi fumini ku meno bende ko, kansi ku Nzambi wu mfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Tala ti Muntu tiidi mu sadila luzolo lu Nzambi, waazaba tala ti ndongosolo ani ku Nzambi yikwe fumanga hoti mu lutumu lu meno bende nina zonzilanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Muntu wuna zonzila mu lutumu lu yandi bende, wuna sosa nkembo yi yandi bende. Kansi muntu wuna sosa nkembo yi yondowo wu mufidisi, kwe tanga kedika, mpe luvunu luu mu yandi. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mose kaluhaana Misiku ko e? Kansi kani muntu wumosi mu yeno kwe sadilanga myo. Mu dyambu di nki luna sosila mu mpondisa e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mpumbu yi bantu yimuvutudila ti: «Mpeve yimbi yi naku! Nani wuna sosa mu kuhondisa e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Mu dyambu dimosi kwandi di mpidikidi, lumeni yituku bamvimba. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Mose wulutuma mu zengoso baala bubakala. Ntumunu beyoyo yifuma ku yandi ko, kansi ku bankaka zeto zintete, kadi yeno lukwe zengosongo baala bubakala mu kilumbu ki saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Tala ti lufweti zengoso baala bubakala mu kilumbu ki saba, mwanki luvumina Misiku mi Mose, mu dyambu di nki luna mfwemina bu nanyakisi muntu mu kilumbu ki saba e? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Bikeeno mu fundisa bonso bu luna yenina mu meso meno, kansi fundisileeno mu ludedomo.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mesiya kadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu ba Yelusalemi bafulasana ti: «Muntu bewuwu ka yandi ko bana sosa mu hondisa e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Taleno kweno: wuna zonza ha meso ma bantu na bana muteela kani dyambu dimosi ko! Mintwadisi myeto nkatika mi bakudi ti yandi ni Klisto e? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kansi Klisto bu kaakwiza, ku muntu ko waazaba kwedi kaafuma, kadi yunduwu tuzebi kwedi kafumini.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu bu kedi longanga mu nzo-Nzambi, wubokana ti: «Meno lunzebi e? Mpe luzebi kwedi mfumini e? Mpeleko nayizidi mu luzolo lu meno bende ko, kansi yondowo wu mfidisi kedika kadi. Yandi, lumuzebi ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Meno, namuzebi, mu dyambu ti ku yandi mfumini mpe yandi wu mfidisi.»<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Basosa mu mukanga, kansi kunaani muntu wumusimba, mu dyambu ti kilokola kyandi kiba buna kyafweni ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Babingi mu kati di mpumbu yi bantu bamukwikila, na bata ti: «Kilumbu kyaakwiza Klisto, nganunu mbo kasa bimangu bingitukulu bihyokidi na byo bilembolo hidika muntu bewuwu e?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Bafalisi bayuwa manyungunyungu mu kati di mpumbu yi bantu mu dyambu di Yesu. Ni hahoho, zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na Bafalisi batambika minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi mu kwe mukanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu wuta ti: «Nakidi dyaka neeno mwa ntangu yifyoti, ku manima mbo nenda ku yondowo wu mfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Yeno lwaansosa na yeno lwaanyena ko, mu dyambu ti lulendi kwiza ku nidi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Mfumu zi Bayudayo bakifuula yawu na yawu ti: «Kwedi kaakwenda mwanki yeto tulembolo muyena e? Ku Bayudayo kaakwenda bameni mwangana mu nsi yi Bangeleke mpe mu haana ndongosolo andi ku Bangeleke e? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nkye mbangululu yi misamu mi kateedi ti: “Yeno lwaansosa na yeno lwaanyena ko, mu dyambu ti lulendi tuula ho ha naaba ko e?”»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamba ma kwe haananga luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mu kilumbu ki manunu ki mukembo, kilumbu ki vudidi mfunu, Yesu mantelama, wubokana ti: «Tala ti muntu wuu na mpwila, kiza ku meno na kanwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Yondowo kwikidi mu meno bonso bu ta masonama, “nzadi zi mamba zi kwe haananga luzingu zaakumba mu yandi.”» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu wuzonzila bobo mu dyambu di Mpeve yi Nzambi yaatambula yobobo baakwikila mu yandi. Mu ntangu beyoyo buna ka tambikidi Mpeve ko mu dyambu ti buna Yesu ka kemboso ko.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ku manima me yuwa misamu bemyomyo, mwa ndambu yi bantu mu kati di mpumbu bata ti: «Bakala bedidi nkatika ni yandi Mumbikudi!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakaka bata ti: «Yandi ni Klisto!» Kansi bakaka bata dyaka ti: «Kadi Klisto ku Ngalili kaafumina e? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Masonama mana ta ko ti: Klisto waafuma mu nkuna yi Davidi ku Betelemi, bwala bu Davidi e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Nkabani yikotila ha mpumbu yi bantu mu dyambu di Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu ha kati dyawu batya bamukanga, kansi ku muntu ko wu musimba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi bu mivutuka ku zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na Bafalisi, ba bafuula ti: «Nki lulembolo mutwadila e?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi mivutula ti: «Kunani muntu wuzonzila bonso buna zonzila muntu bewowo!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bafalisi ba bafuula ti: «Yeno mpe luhunukini kweno e? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Nganunu wumosi mu zimfumu hoti mu Bafalisi wu mukwikidi e? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Mpumbu yi bantu beyiyi yi lembolo zaba Misiku mi Mose, yiloko yidi.»<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Kansi Nikodemo, wumosi mu Bafalisi wuyenda yenikina Yesu bilumbu bihyoka, wuta ti: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Misiku myeto mina tudika mu fundisa muntu tala ti lumuyudi ntete ko mu zaba nki kasiidi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Ngeye mpe mwisi-Ngalili wudi e?» Tanga bumbote Masonama mbo wubakula ti kuu mumbikudi kani wumosi ko wufuma ku Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />[Ku manima, kadi muntu wuyenda ku nzo andi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mukento wu nsuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu wuyenda ku mulandu wu miti mi Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mu minkyela mi bwisi, wuvutuka ku nzo-Nzambi na bantu bayiza ha ntadisi andi. Bu kazakala ni katona mu balonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Milongisi mi Misiku na Bafalisi bamutwadila mukento wumosi wu babatikisa buna wuna sadila kinsuza. Bamutuula ha kati-kati di bantu bamvimba <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />na bafuula Yesu ti: «Mulongisi, mukento bewuwu, bamubatikisi buna wuna sadila kinsuza. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mu Misiku, Mose wuna tutuma mu honda mu matadi bakento bamutindu bewuwu. Bwabu ngeye, nki wunata e?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bamuvwika kyuhu bekyokyo, mu mutambila mutambu, mwanki ba baka kibila kye mufundila. Kansi, Yesu wuyinama na wutona mu sonika ha nsi mu mulembo. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Bu bedi tatamana mu muvwika byuhu, Yesu wusungika mutu na wuta ti: «Bika yondowo lembolo ba na disumu, kaba wuntete mu muwinda tadi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ku manima, wubwesa yinama na wutona dyaka mu sonika ha nsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bu bayuwa bobo, batona mu kwenda wumosi-wumosi, kutonina ku ba bihunda. Yesu wusaala yandi kaka na mukento bewowo wuba wutelama ha kati di lukongolo. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Bu kasungika mutu, Yesu wumufuula ti: «Mukento, bakufundidi kwedi badi e? Ku muntu ko wu kuheeni kitumbu e?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, ka muntu ko.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Yenda kwaku, meno mpe nakuhaana kitumbu ko, kansi kubwesandi sumuka ko.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, ni kya ku nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Meno nidi kya ku nza. Wonso muntu waandanda, kaadyata mu tombe ko, kansi waabaka kya ku luzingu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bafalisi bamuteela ti: «Wuna ta kimbangi mu nge bende, buna kimbangi kyaku kii kikedika ko.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Tala ti nteedi kimbangi mu me bende, kimbangi kyani kikedika kidi, mu dyambu ti nzebi kwedi mfumini na kwedi nina kwenda. Kansi yeno luzebi ko kwedi mfumini na kwedi nina kwenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Yeno mu kinsuni lukwe fundisilanga, meno na fundisanga muntu ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Tala ti meno mfundisi, lufundusu lwani lu kedika ludi, mu dyambu ti nii me kaka ko: Tata wu mfidisi wu nani kintwadi. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mu Misiku myeno wuu wusonama ti kimbangi ki bantu bole, kikedika kidi. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Meno, nina ta kimbangi mu me bende, na Tata mpe wu mfidisi wuna nteela kimbangi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bamufuula ti: «Tata aku kwedi kadi e?» Yesu wuvutula ti: «Yeno lunzebi ko na luzebi Tata ani ko. Tala ti lunzebi, nganunu luketi zaba mpe Tata ani.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu wuduukisa mpova bezozo buna wuna longa mu nzo-Nzambi, ha ntendo kima ki bakwe haaninanga minkayulu. Ku muntu wu mukanga mu dyambu ti ntangu andi yiba buna yafweni ko.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Nzambi wu mufidisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Naakwenda, mpe lwaansosa. Kansi yeno lwaafwa mu masumu meno. Lulendi kwenda kuma ku naakwenda ko.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bayudayo bakifuula yawu na yawu ti: «Kuhonda kakihonda e? Mu dyambu ti teedi ti: “lulendi kwiza ku nina kwenda ko”» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Yeno ha butoto lufuma, meno ku yulu nafuma. Yeno bisi-nza beyiyi ludi, meno nidi mwisi-nza beyiyi ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ni hahoho nalutedidi ti yeno mu masumu meno lwaafwila. Tala ti lukwikidi ko ti meno ni “Nidi”, mu masumu meno lwaafwila.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bamufuula ti: «Ngeye ni nani e?» Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Misamu myamyomyo nina luteelanga tuka ku mbadukulu. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Misamu mi lutadidi, mimingi mii nani mu luteela na mu lufundisa. Kansi yondowo wu mfidisi, kedika kakwe tanga, mpe meno mi nyudi ku yandi, ni myamyomyo nina zabikisa mu nza.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Babakula ko ti ni Tata kedi bazonzila. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Buna Yesu wubateela ti: «Mu ntangu yi lwaazangula Mwana Muntu, mbo lubakula ti ni meno “Nidi”, mpe naahidika ka musamu mu luzolo lu me bende ko. Kansi nina zonza kaka misamu mi ndonga Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yondowo wu mfidisi, wuu nani kintwadi, kambikanga me kaka ko, mu dyambu ti nkwe hidikanga kaka misamu mi katiidi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Bu kedi zonzilanga bobo, babingi bamukwikila.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkuna yi Abalahami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu wuta ku Bayudayo ba mukwikila ti: «Tala ti luu bakwikama mu mambu mani, nkatika milongoki myani ludi, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />lwaazaba kedika, mpe kedika kyaaluhaana kimpwanza.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Yeto mu nkuna yi Abalahami tudi na twabedi mindongo mi muntu ko. Bila nki lendi tuteela ti: “mbo lubaka kimpwanza e?”» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika naluteedidi, wonso sumukini, weka mundongo wu disumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mundongo kalendi sikila mvimba mu kanda di kadi ko, kansi mwana kwe sikilanga mvimba mu kanda . <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Tala ti Mwana wuluheeni kimpwanza, kedika mbo luba mu kimpwanza. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nzebi ti mu nkuna yi Abalahami ludi. kansi luna sosa mu mpondoso mu dyambu ti lutambudi mambu mani ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Meno nina luzonzila misamu mi nayeni ku Tata ani, yeno mpe, sadileeno misamu mi lulongokidi ku tata eno.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Tata eto ni Abalahami.» Yesu wubateela ti: «Tala ti baala ba Abalahami ludi, nganunu luketi sadila bonso Abalahami. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mpeleko naluteedidi kedika ki nalongokidi ku Nzambi, kansi, yeno luna sosa kaka mu mpondisa. Abalahami kasadila nsalulu beyoyo ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Yeno, luna sadila bonso tata eno.» Bamuvutudila ti: «Yeto tuu baala ba makangu ko. Tata dimosi kwandi di neto, ni Nzambi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu wuta dyaka ti: «Tala ti Nzambi nkatika Tata eno kadi, nganunu lukwe ntyanga, mu dyambu ti ku Nzambi nafumini mpe mu nkumbu andi nii haha. Nayizidi mu luve lu me bende ko, kansi yandi wu mfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Bila nki luna lembolo bakudila mi nina luteela e? Mu dyambu ti lukwe lembananga mu yuwa mambu mani. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Yeno Tata eno ni nkadyampemba, mpe lukwe ntyanga mu sadila luzolo lu tata eno. Tuka mu mbadukulu, mumpondi wunaani wudi. Kakwe tanga kedika ko mu dyambu ti kaa muntu wu kedika ko. Bu kakwe tanga luvunu, luvunu lufwanakani na nkadulu andi, mu dyambu ti kihuni kidi na tata di luvunu kadi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kansi meno nina ta kedika, kansi luna nkwikila ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nani mu yeno lenda lonka ti disumu nsidi e? Tala ti kedika nina ta, bila nki yeno luna lembolo nkwikidila e? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Wonso wuu mu Nzambi, kwe yuwanga mambu ma Nzambi. Tala ti, yeno lukwe yuwanga mo ko, mu dyambu ti luu mu Nzambi ko.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Bayudayo bavutudila Yesu ti: «Kedika kyeto mu ta ti mu Samaliya wudi na mpeve yimbi yi naaku e?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Meno nii na mpeve yimbi ko. Tata ani nina zitisa, kansi yeno luna bisa mu nzitisa. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Meno nina sosa masiika mani ko. Kuu na muntu wumosi wuna nsosila mo nakwe fundisanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, ti muntu kebidi mambu mani, kaafwa ko.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Bayudayo bamuteela ti: «Bwabu tubakudi ti nkatika mpeve yimbi yi naku! Abalahami wufwa, bamimbikudi mpe bafwa, kansi ngeye wunata ti: “Tala ti muntu kebidi mambu mani, kaafwa ko.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Nganunu ngeye hyokidi na tata eto Abalahami e? Yandi wufwa na mimbikudi mpe mifwa. Ngeye nani wuna kibongila e?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Tala ti nina kisiika me bende, masiika mani maaba ma mpamba. Tata ani wuna nsiika wu lukwe tumisinanga ti: “Nzambi eto”, <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />yeno lumuzebi ko, kansi meno namuzebi. Tala ti naluteedidi ti namuzebi ko, naaba muntu wu luvunu bonso yeno. Kansi meno namuzebi mpe nkwe kebanga mambu mandi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tata eno Abalahami, wuyangalala bubwingi bu kayindula mu yena kilumbu kyani. Wuyena kyo mpe wuyangalala.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bayudayo bamuteela ti: «Ngeye walungisi mvula makumatanu ko na wuna ta ti Abalahami yandi wuyena!» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela ti: tekila Abalahami kabutuka, meno “nidi”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ni batota matadi mu muwinda mo. Kansi Yesu wuswama na wuduuka mu nzo-Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mpofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu bu kedi hyoka mu nzila, wuyena bakala dimosi diba mpofo tuka mbutukulu andi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Milongoki myandi mi mufuula ti: «Mulongisi, nani wusumuka, yandi hoti bibuti byandi, mwanki kabutuka mpofo e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Ka yandi ko hoti bibuti byandi ko basumuka. Mwanki mavanga ma Nzambi mayenika mu yandi. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Bwisi bu bwakidi bukya, tufweti sala bisalu bi yondowo wu mfidisi, mpimpa yeka bela-bela, ka muntu kalendi bwesa sala ko. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Bu nakidi mu nza, meno nidi kya ku nza.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza, wulobola mante ha nsi na wuhidika nteke mu mante mandi, ni kakukusa yo mu meso ma mpofo, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ni kamuteela ti: «Yenda wuyobila ku kizinga ki Silowa», mbangudulu ti <char style="wj"><optbreak />"Ntumwa"<optbreak />Muntu wu batambikidi</char>. Mpofo wuyenda, ni kayobila na mu nzila bu kedi kwe vutuki, meso mandi ni mayena.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bantu bedi banga nandi bela-bela na bantu bedi muyenanga mu ntangu yi kedi sanga mundombila bata ti: «Ka yandi ko wedi banga wuzakala na wedi sanga mundombila e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Kuba na bantu bedi tanga ti: «Yandi.» Bakaka ti: «Kaani, ka yandi ko, kansi fwanakani nandi.» Yandi bende wedi ta ti: «Nkatika ni meno.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bamufuula ti: «Bwedi bwabu meso maku mazibukidi e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Wubavutudila ti: «Muntu wu nkumbu Yesu hidikidi mwa nteke, nkusidi yo mu meso mani na ntedidi ti: “Yenda yobila ku Silowa.” Nenzi, nyobidi mboki meso mani mayeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bamufuula ti: «Kwedi kadi Muntu bewowo e?» Wuvutula ti: «Nzebi ko.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalisi na mpofo yi nyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Banata ku Bafalisi muntu wuba mpofo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kiba kilumbu ki saba Yesu kamukusa nteke na kamuzibula meso. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Bafalisi yawu mpe bamufuula mu zaba bwedi kanyakina. Wubavutudila ti: «Nteke kankusidi mu meso, bu nyobidingi, bwabu meso mani mayeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mwa kabu di Bafalisi bata ti: «Muntu bewuwu kafumini ku Nzambi ko, mu dyambu ti kana vumina saba ko.» Bakaka bavutula ti: «Bwedi munsumuki kalendi lonkila bimangu bi bobobo e?» Nkabani ni yi kota ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bafalisi bamufuula dyaka ti: «Mbo ngeye, nki wuna ta mu yondowo wukuzibudi meso e?» Wuvutula ti: «Mumbikudi kadi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Kansi mfumu zi Bayudayo bakwikila ko ti mpofo kaba na bwabu yeni. Ni hahoho batumisina bibuti byandi, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />ni bedi bavwikanga byuhu ti: «Nkatika mwana eno wudi e? Lusingisi wo ti mpofo kabutuka e? Nki bisidi ti bwabu kayena e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Bibuti bavutula ti: «Tuzebi ti mwana eto wudi na wubutuka mpofo. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Kansi bwedi bwabu meso mamuzibukidi, wowowo tuzebi wo ko! Mpe tuzebi ko nani wumuzibudi meso! Muvwikeeno byuhu, yandi bende wukula kadi mu luvutudila mvutu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Bibuti byandi bazonzila bobo mu dyambu ti baba na bunkuta bu zimfumu zi Bayudayo. Yawu bayuwasana mu kuma mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo wonso muntu waasingisa ti Yesu, ni Klisto kadi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ni hahoho bibuti bata ti: «Wukula kadi, muvwikeeno byuhu yandi bende!»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bafalisi batumisa dyaka yondowo wuba mpofo na bamuteela ti: «Kembisa Nzambi mu ta kikedika. Tuzebi ti Muntu bewowo munsumuki wudi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Wuvutula ti: «Nzebi ani ko tala ti munsumuki kadi. Kansi dyambu dimosi kaka nzebi: Mpofo mbedi, bwabu nina yena.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bamuvwika byuhu ti: «Nki kakusiidi e? Bwedi kakuzibudidi meso e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Wubavutudila ti: «Wa natekidi luteela, kansi lunyuwidi ko. Bwabu nki luna sosila mu yuwa wo dyaka e? Yeno mpe lutiidi luba milongoki myandi e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bamutuka na bata ti: «Ngeye wudi mulongoki andi. Yeto milongoki mi Mose tudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Yeto tuzebi ti Nzambi wuzonza ku Mose, kansi yondowo tuzebi ko kwedi kafumini.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Mpofo wubavutudila ti: «Dyambu dingitukulu nina yena: luzebi ko kwedi kafumini, mpeleko zibudi meso mani! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tuzebi ti Nzambi kayuwilanga minsumuki ko, kansi kwe yuwilanga wonso muntu kwe mu zitisanga na kwe sadilanga luzolo lwandi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tuka mu tuka, twayudi ko ti muntu zibudi meso ma muntu wu butukidi mpofo. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Tala ti yandi kafuma ku Nzambi ko, nga kalendi hidika mibubu ko.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Ngeye wudi munsumuki tuka mbutukulu aku, kansi ngeye tiidi mu tuhaana ndongosolo e?» Ni bamukuma ku mbazi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu bu kayuwa ti bamukumini ku mbazi, wuyenda mutala na wumufula ti: «Ngeye kwikidi mu Mwana Muntu e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, kadi nani wo, mwanki na mukwikila e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Wuna muyena, yondowo wu nazonza naku, ni yando.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Buna wuta ti: «Nkwikidi Mfumu.» Ni kafukama ha ntadisi andi luse ha nsi. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Mboki Yesu wuta ti: «Nayizidi mu nza beyiyi mwanki mfundusu yi ba: mwanki zimpofo ziyena mpe yobobo bakwe yenanga, bakituka zimpofo.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mwa ndambu yi Bafalisi baba nandi, bayuwa misamu bemyomyo, bamufuula ti: «Yeto mpe bwabu zimpofo tweka e?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Tala ti zimpofo ludi, nganunu ludyeno na masumu ko. Kansi luteedi ti: “Tuna yena”, bwabu masumu makwa neeno.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki Mumvungi na mameme mandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, yondowo lembolo kotila ha mwelo wu lupangu lu mameme, kansi makini ha kibuka kikaka, mwivi na kinkita kadi. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Kansi yondowo kotidi ha mwelo, mumvungi wu mameme kadi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Munkengi kwe muzibudilanga mwelo na mameme makwe yuwanga ndinga andi. Mu mameme ma kavwidi, yandi kwe tumisinanga kadi dimeme mu nkumbu andi na kwe natanga mo ku mbazi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bu kameni duukisa mamvimba, wuna kwe yenzi ha mutwala awu, mboki mameme mana kwe mulandi ha manima, mu dyambu ti mazeebi ndinga andi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Makwe landanga muntu wu malembolo zaba ko, kansi kuwoka makwe muwokanga, mu dyambu ti mazeebi ndinga andi ko.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu wubateela kingana bekyokyo, kansi bantu bedi muyuwa, babakula misamu mi kedi bateela ko.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mumvungi wumbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, meno nidi mwelo wu lupangu lu mameme. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bamvimba bebobo bantekidila, mivi midi na binkita binaani, kansi mameme ma bayuwila ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Meno nii mwelo. Muntu waahyokila mu nzila ani waavuuka. Waakota, waaduuka mpe waabaka bindya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwivi wukwe kwizanga mu yiba, mu honda na mu mwangisa. Meno nayizidi mwanki babaka luzingu, na babaka lo luhyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Meno nii mumvungi wumbote. Mumvungi wumbote kwe hombisanga luzingu lwandi mu dyambu di mameme mandi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Kansi muntu bewowo kwe salanga mu dyambu di mbongo, kaa mumvungi ko mpe kavwidi mameme ko. Kamana yena ngo yina kwiza, waasa myanga mo na waawoka kwandi. Ngo bu yaakota, yaabwila na yaamwangisa mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Budidi ti mu dyambu di mbongo kwandi kisadi bekyokyo ki kwe sadilanga, ka na kyadi ki mameme ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Meno nii mumvungi wumbote. Nzebi mameme mani na mameme manzebi, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />bonso Tata bu kanzebi, meno mpe nzebi Tata. Mpe naahaana luzingu lwani mu dyambu di mameme maani. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nii dyaka na mameme mahiika malembolo ba ku kati di lupangu belulu. Mawu mpe, mfweti ma twadisa na mayuwa ndinga ani, mukangu wumosi maaba mpe mumvungi wumosi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Tata wuntiidi, mu dyambu ti meno nina haana luzingu lwani, mu bwesa baka lo dyaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kunaani muntu lenda mbonga luzingu, kansi meno bende nkwe haananga lo. Nii na lulendo mu haana lo na mu bwesa lwe baka. Yo ni ntumunu yi mpana Tata ani.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Mpova bezozo zinata dyaka nkabani ha kati di Bayudayo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Babingi ha kati di bantu bebobo bata ti: «Mpeve yimbi yi nandi, kilahuki kidi. Kadi nki luna muyuwila e?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Kansi bahiika bavutula ti: «Muntu wuu na mpeve yimbi kalendi zonzila bobo ko. Kadi mpeve yimbi yi lendi zibula meso ma zimpofo e?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudayo bana kwikila Yesu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Mukembo wu mbyekolo yi nzo-Nzambi wuba ku Yelusalemi. Yiba nsungi yi kyozi kingolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu wedi kwe zungani mu nzo-Nzambi, ku nsye musampa wu Solomo. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Bayudayo bamuzungidila na bamufuula ti: «Natee mu nkye ntangu waasa ti tuba mu maketiketi e? Tala ti ngeye ni Mesiya, tumbu tuteela wo.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Wa naluteedidi, na luna kwikila ko. Bisalu bi nina sala mu nkumbu Tata ani, bina nteela kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Kansi luna kwikila ko, mu dyambu ti luu mu kabu di mameme mani ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mameme mani makwe yuwanga ndinga ani, ma nazebi mpe makwe ndandanga. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nkwe haananga mo luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Malendi hombila ko na kunaani muntu lendi nzika mo ha moko mani. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tata ani wumpana mo vudi lulendo na bamvimba, mpe kunaani muntu lendi zika mo mu moko ma Tata ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Meno na Tata tudi muntu wumosi.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bayudayo babwesa tota matadi mu muwinda mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Kansi Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Naluhidikidi misamu mimingi mimbote mifumini ku Tata. Mu nkye musamu bwabu lutiidi mu mpondila mu matadi e?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bayudayo bamuvutudila ti: «Ka mu dyambu di musamu wumbote ko tuna sosa mu kuhonda mu matadi, kansi mu dyambu ti safudi Nzambi: ngeye muntu kwa wudi na wuna kisikisa ti Nzambi wudi.» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu wuta dyaka ti: «Nganunu wudi wusonama mu Misiku myeno ko ti: “Ntedi ti, yeno zinzambi ludi” e? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Tuzebi ti balendi katula mo masonoko mu Masonama ko. Mpe, Musiku wuna tumisina zinzambi yobobo basamununu mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Meno mpe Nzambi wunsola na wuntambika mu nza. Bwedi lulenda teela ti meno nina safula Nzambi, mu dyambu ti nsingisi ti: “Meno Mwana Nzambi nidi” e? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Tala ti nsedi bisalu bi Tata ani ko, buna lunkwikilandi ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Kansi, tala ti nsedi byo, mpeleko lwaankwikila ko, kwikileeno kani mu bisalu bi nasidi mwanki luzaba na lubakula ti Tata wuu mu meno na meno nii mu Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Basosa dyaka mu mukanga, kansi bamubaka ko.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu wuvutuka ku simu di kaka di nzadi yi Yolodani, ha kibuka kyedi botikilanga Yoane bantu. Ni kazakala hoho. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bantu babingi bayiza kuu yandi na bata ti: «Yoane kahidika nakani kimangu kimosi kingitukulu ko. Kansi mimvimba mi kazonzila mu muntu bewowo mii mi kedika.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ha kibuka bekyokyo bantu babingi bakwikila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Lazalo, nkayi yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Lazalo, wuba na kimbevo. Mwisi-Betani kaba, bwala bu Maliya na Malata, bibusi byandi. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliya ni mukento bewowo wu mwangumuna mananasi ha yulu bitambi bi Mfumu na wukusuna byo mu milengi myandi. Mpangi andi wu nkumbu Lazalo, wuba na kimbevo. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bibusi bya bibyole, batambika ntumi ku Yesu ti: «Mfumu, yondowo wukwe tyanga, wubela kadi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu bu kayuwa musamu bewowo, ni kata ti: «Kimbevo bekiki kyaamunata ku lufwa ko. Kansi kyaaba kidimbu kyaahaana nkembo ku Nzambi, mwanki mu kimbevo bekyokyo nkembo yi Mwana Nzambi yiyenika.»<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu wedi tyanga Malata na mpangi andi yi mukento, mpe na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Mpeleko wuyuwa ti Lazalo wuba wubeela, kansi wuzakala dyaka bilumbu byole ha kibuka ki kabeela, <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />mboki, wuta ku milongoki myandi ti: «Tuvutukeno ku kizunga ki Yuda.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Milongoki mi muvutudila ti: «Mulongisi, mwa bilumbu bebibi kwandi, Bayudayo basosidi mu kuhonda mu matadi. Bwabu tiidi mu vutuka koko e?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Nga kuu na bilokola kumi na byole bi kukya mu kilumbu ko e? Tala ti muntu wuna dyata mu kya, kalendi ta kuba ko, mu dyambu ti wuna yena kya ku nza beyiyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kansi, tala ti muntu wuna dyata mu mpimpa, waata kuba mu dyambu ti kya kuu mu yandi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Bu kamana zonza bobo, wubwesa ta ti: «Nkayi eto Lazalo bwidi tolo, kansi nenzi mu muvumbula.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Milongoki mivutula ti: «Mfumu, tala ti tolo kwa kabwidi, waanyaka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu wuzonzila lufwa lu Lazalo, kansi milongoki mi banzila ti ni tolo kwandi tumpamba kana zonzila. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu ni katumbu bahubudila wo ti: «Lazalo fwidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Mu yeno, nyangaladi mu dyambu ti nabedi koko, mwanki lukwikila. Kansi twendeeno ku kadi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toma, wuba kwe tumisinanga ti dipasa, wuta ku milongoki mihiika ti: «Twendeeno yeto mpe, mwanki tufwa ha kimosi nandi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni mfulukulu na luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu bu katula, wuyuwa ti Lazalo weka bilumbu bi ya mu ndyamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bwala bu Betani buba bela-bela na mbanza yi Yelusalemi, kampe kilometele zi tatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bayudayo babingi bayiza ku Malata na Maliya mu babomba mu lufwa lu nkazi awu.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Malata bu kayuwa ti Yesu wuna kwiza, ni kayenda mubwana, kansi Maliya wusala kwandi wuzakala mu nzo. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malata wuteela Yesu ti: «Mfumu, tala ti ha kwa wubedi, nganunu nkazi ani kafwidi ko. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Kansi bwabu nzebi ti mu kilokola bekiki, mamvimba ma waalomba ku Nzambi, Nzambi waakuhaana mo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu wuta ti: «Nkazi aku waafuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malata wuvutula ti: «Nzebi ti mbo kafuluka mu bafwa mu kilumbu kinsukunu, ki mfulukulu yi bafwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Ni meno nii mfulukulu na moyo. Wonso kwikidi mu meno, waaba moyo, kaati fwiidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Mpe wonso muntu wuna zinga na kwikidi mu meno, kaafwa ko. Dyambu dyo dyakwikidi e?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malata wuvutula ti: «Ninga Mfumu, nkwikidi ti ngeye ni Klisto, Mwana Nzambi, yondowo fweti kwiza mu nza.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wudila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Bu kamana zonza bobo, Malata wuyenda tumisa mpangi andi Maliya na wumuteela munsweki ti: «Mulongisi tudidi na wuna kusosa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliya bu kayuwa bobo, wutumbu telama na wuyenda ku beela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Mu dyambu ti Yesu kakikotila ha bwala ko, kansi wuba ntete ha kibuka kiyenda mubwana Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Bayudayo baba na Maliya mu nzo mu mubomba, bu bamuyena ti telamani mu muswalu na duukidi, ni bamulanda mu dyambu ti bedi banzila ti ku ndyamu kenzi mu kwe dila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maliya bu katuula ha kibuka kibela Yesu, bu kamuyena, wubwa ha malu mandi na wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, tala ti ha kwa wubedi, nganunu nkazi ani kafwidi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu bu kamuyena ti wuna dila, na bayudayo bayiza nandi mpe bana dila, wuyena kyadi kikingi na mutima andi wuvizuka. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Wubafuula ti: «Kwedi lumuzikidi e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, yiza wutala.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu wudila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ni hahoho, Bayudayo bateela ti: «Taleno! Wu be toma mutya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Kansi mwa ndambu ha kati dyawu bata ti: «Yandi wuzibula meso ma mpofo, bwabu nki kalembolo sila ti Lazalo kafwandi e?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfulukulu yi Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu wuyena dyaka kyadi kikingi na wuyenda ku ndyamu. Ndyamu beyoyo yiba mu ntadi, na mwelo wunkotolo wuba wukangu mu tadi didinene. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu wuta ti: «Katuleeno tadi.» Malata, kibusi ki yondowo wufwidi, wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, wuna duuka bwabu mfuku, mu dyambu ti byeka bilumbu biya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Na kuteedidi wo ko ti, tala ti kwikidi, mbo wuyena nkembo wu Nzambi e?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Bakatula tadi. Yesu wusendola meso ku yulu, wuta ti: «Tata, nakuvutudidi matondo mu dyambu ti nyuwidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Meno nzebi ti konso ntangu kwe nyuwilanga, kansi nzonzidi mu dyambu di mpumbu yi bantu beyiyi yi nzungididi, mwanki bakwikila ti ngeye wu mfidisi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Bu kamana zonza bobo, wuzonza mu ngolo ti: «Lazalo, duuka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazalo wuba wufwa duukidi, malu na moko makangama mu bitende, mpe kini kizingu mu mulele. Yesu wuta ti: «Munyanguneeno na mubikeno kenda.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakotila Yesu manenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayudayo babingi mu yobobo bayiza ku Maliya, bu bayena mi hidika Yesu, bamukwikila.<verse eid="JHN 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Kansi mwa ndambu yi bantu yiyenda yenikina Bafalisi na yi bayadila myo mi hidika Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ni hahoho, zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na Bafalisi bakutikisa kimvuka ki bakuluntu ki Bayudayo, ni bata ti: «Nki twaasa e? Muntu bewuwu bidimbu bingitukulu kana sa. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Tumana mu bika mu sa bobo, bamvimba baamukwikila, bisi-Loma baakwiza, mpe baamwangisa kibuka kyeto ki longo na nsi eto.» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Wumosi mu kati dyawu nkumbu andi Kayifa, wuba mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi mumvu bewowo, wuta ti: «Nkatika luna bakula wo ko! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Luna yena ko ti bulutidi bumbote muntu wumosi kafwa mu dyambu di mukangu, na mu bika nsi yimvimba yi hombila kwandi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Mpova bezozo zi fuma ku yandi bende ko, kansi, bu kaba ti mfumu yi nganga-Nzambi mu mumvu bewowo, wubikula ti Yesu mbo kafwa mu dyambu di mukangu, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />mpe ka mu dyambu di mukangu kaka ko, kansi mu bundisa ha kimosi baala ba Nzambi bameni mwangana.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Tuka kilumbu bekyokyo, babaka nzengolo mu hondoso Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ni hahoho, Yesu kedi bwesa kwe yeniki dyaka ha meso ma Bayudayo ko. Wuyenda ku kizunga ki bela-bela na nsi yinkatu, ku mbanza yi nkumbu Efalayimi. Wuzakala koko na milongoki myandi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Mukembo wu Pake wu Bayudayo, wuba bela-bela, mpe bantu babingi batomboka ku Yelusalemi mu kivedisa tekila Pake yi tuula. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Basosa Yesu mu ntangu yibaba mu nzo-Nzambi. Bedi fulasana yawu na yawu ti: «Bwedi luna yenina e? Kana kwiza ku mukembo ko e?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na Bafalisi bahaana ntumunu eyi: Wonso muntu zebi nkye kibuka Yesu kadi, kiza katuteela mwanki tumukanga.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Maliya wubulumuna Yesu mananasi ha bitambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Bilumbu bisambanu tekila mukembo wu Pake wutula, Yesu wuyenda ku bwala bu Betani kwedi zakidilanga Lazalo, yondowo wukafulukisa mu bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Balambila Yesu bindya koko. Malata wedi bakabidila bindya, mpe Lazalo wuba ha kati di yobobo baaba bazakala ha meza na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maliya wubonga ndambu litele yi mananasi ma nale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nale: mananasi ma bahidikila mu muti nkumbu nale</char></note> mantalu yiyingi, malembolo vwatana na kima kihiika. Wubulumuna mo ha bitambi bi Yesu, mpe wukusuna bitambi bebyobyo mu milengi myandi. Nzo yimvimba yifuluka mu mfuku yi mananasi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda Isikalyoti, wumosi mu milongoki mi Yesu, yondowo waamuyekola, wuta ti: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Bila nki tulembolo yadikila kwandi mananasi bemama mu nkamatatu zi mbongo zi bisengo, mwanki bahaana zo ku bamputu e?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Wuzonzila bobo ka mu dyambu di kyadi ki bamputu kiba nandi ko, kansi mu dyambu ti mwivi wuba. Yandi wedi kebanga nkutu yi mbongo, ni kedi yibanga mbongo zi bedi tulanga momo. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Kansi Yesu wuta ti: «Lumukwamisandi ko! Kasididi bobo mu dyambu di kilumbu kinzikulu ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Bamputu baaba neeno ntangu zimvimba, kansi meno naaba neeno ntangu zimvimba ko.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basila Lazalo mfundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mpumbu yiyinene yi Bayudayo yizaba ti Yesu wu ku Betani. Ni yiyenda koko, ka mu dyambu di Yesu kaka ko, kansi mu yena mpe Lazalo, yondowo Yesu wukafulukisa mu bafwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi ni zibonga mukanu we hondisa mpe Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />mu dyambu ti Bayudayo babingi bakatuka mu kimvuka kyawu mu dyambu dyandi, mpe bakwikila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkotolo yi Yesu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Kilumbu kilanda, mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yiyiza ku mukembo wu Pake, yiyuwa ti Yesu wuna kwiza ku mbanza Yelusalemi. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Bantu bamvimba babonga mandala mu moko na bayenda mubwana. Bedi kwe tengi mu ngolo ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Ozana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Bika Nzambi kasakumuna muntu wuna kwiza mu nkumbu yi Mfumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Bika Nzambi kasakumuna Ntinu yi Isaeli!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu wuyena mwana wu mbuluku, ni kazakala ha yulu andi, bonso budi busonama ti:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Kuyenandi bunkuta ko, ndumba yi Syoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Tala, Ntinu aku wuna kwiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Wuu wuzakala ha yulu mwana wu mbuluku yi nkento<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zakaliya 9.9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Milongoki myandi mi tumbu bakula misamu bemyomyo ko. Kansi Yesu bu kazangulu mu nkembo, ni babambuka moyo ti mii misonama mu dyambu dyandi, mpe misamu mimvimba mihilama bonso bu bazonzila myo mu yandi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bamvimba baba na Yesu mu ntangu yi katumisa Lazalo ku mbazi yi ndyamu, mu mufulukisa mu bafwa, bamuteela kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ni hahoho, mpumbu yi bantu yiyizila mu bwana Yesu: yiyuwa ti kimangu kingitukulu kasiidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Bafalisi ni bateelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Taleno! Lwaalenda ko. bamvimba yandi bana kwe landi.»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bangeleke basosa mu yena Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kuba na mwa ndambu yi Bangeleke mu bantu ba tomboka ku Yelusalemi, mu kwe sambila Nzambi mu ntangu yi mukembo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Bayenda tala Filipi, mwisi-Betesayida mu kizunga ki Ngalili, bamuteela ti: «Mfumu, tutiidi mu yena Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipi wuyenda teela wo ku Andele, mboki ya babole bayenda ta wo ku Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Ntangu yifweni yiba kembisa Mwana Muntu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kedika mu kedika naluteedidi, tala ti nswanga yi bele yibwidi ha butoto ko na yifwidi ko, yaaba yawu hika. Kansi, tala ti yifwidi, yabuta mbutu zizingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Yondowo tiidi luzingu lwandi, lwaakahombisa. Kansi yondowo waabela luzingu lwandi lu ha nza beyiyi, lwaakalunda mu dyambu di moyo wu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Tala ti muntu tiidi mu nsadila, kandanda. Mpe hohoho ha naaba, hahoho mpe kisadi kyani kaaba. Tala ti muntu tiidi mu nsadila, ni Tata ani waamukembisa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzonzila lufwa lwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Bwabu mutima ani wuvizukidi. Bwedi nata e? Tata, nkuula kwani mu kilokola bekiki e? Kansi mu dyambu di kilokola bekiki nayizidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, kembisa nkumbu aku!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Buna ndinga yiyuwakana ku yulu ti: «Yakembisi, mpe yanakembisa dyaka.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mpumbu yi bantu yiba hoho na yiyuwa ndinga beyoyo yita ti: «Kidumu kibedi.» Bahiika bata ti: «Mbazi yimuzonzidi.» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Ka mu dyambu dyani ko ndinga beyiyi yiyuwakani, kansi mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Bwabu ntangu ye fundisa nza beyiyi yifweni. Bwabu ntangu ye kuma ku mbazi mfumu yikwe yalanga nza beyiyi yifweni. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Meno mpe, mu ntangu yi baanzangula ha butoto, naabenda bantu bamvimba ku meno.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Mu nzonzolo beyoyo, Yesu wulonka mu nkye mfwilu kaafwila. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mpumbu yi bantu yi muvutudila ti: «Tulongoka mu Misiku ti Klisto waazinga mimvu ka mimvu. Kansi, bwedi lenda teela ti Mwana Muntu fweti zangulu e? Mwana Muntu bewowo ninani e?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: « Lwakidi na kya mu mwa ntangu yifyoti. Dyateeno bu lwakidi na kya, mwanki tombe kilembolo lubatikisa. Mu dyambu ti muntu wuna dyata ku nsye tombe kalendi zaba ko kwedi kana kwendisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Bu lwakidi na kya , kwikileeno mu kya, mwanki luba baala ba kya.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu bu kamana zonza bobo, wuyenda na wuswama kitatu nawu.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudayo bakwikila Yesu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Mpeleko wuhidika bimangu bibingi ha ntadisi awu, kansi bamukwikila ko, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />mwanki mizonza mumbikudi Yesaya myenda detila, bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">« Mfumu, nani kwikidi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">mu ndongolo eto e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Mpe kunaani Mfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">kalonkidi lulendo lwandi e?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Mu dyambu ti bantu bakwikila ko, buna Yesaya wuta dyaka ebu:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Nzambi wubakitula zimpofo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">na wusa ti mitima myawu miba bonso matadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">mwanki balembolo yena mu meso mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">na balembolo bakula mu mitima myawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">mpe bana vilula madyela mawu ko, mwanki nabanyakisa.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Yesaya wuta bobo, mu dyambu ti wuyena nkembo yi Yesu na wedi muzonzila.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Babingi mpe ha kati di zimfumu zi Bayudayo bakwikila Yesu. Kansi mu dyambu di Bafalisi, bakiyenikisa ko, mwanki balembolo bakuma mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Yawu bedi tyanga bubwingi masiika ma bantu, kansi ka ma Nzambi ko.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpova zi Yesu za mfundisa bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu wuzonza mu ngolo ti: «Yondowo wuna kwikila mu meno, ka mu meno kaka ko kana kwikila, kansi mu yondowo wumfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yondowo wuna nyena meno, yeni yondowo wumfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Meno nayizidi mu nza bonso kya, mwanki wonso muntu wuna nkwikila, kalendi ba ku nsye tombe ko. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Tala ti muntu yudi mambu mani na kasadidi mo ko, kameno ko na mu fundisa, mu dyambu ti nayizidi mu fundisa nza ko, kansi mu vuukisa yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Yondowo walembolo ntambula na walembolo kwikila mu mambu mani, beki mumfundisi andi: ni mambu ma nalongidi ma mufundisa mu kilumbu kinsukunu. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ka mu lutumu lu me bende ko nazonzidi, kansi Tata wumfidisi, wumpeeni yandi bende mambu ma mfweti ta na ma mfweti longa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mpe nzebi ti ntumunu andi yikwe haananga luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Ni hahoho, mi nina samuna, nina samuna myo bonso bunteedidi myo Tata.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu sukudi maalu ma milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tekila mukembo wu Pake wutuula, Yesu wuzaba ti ntangu andi yifweni ye sisa nza beyiyi mu kwenda ku Tata. Wutya bantu bandi baba mu nza, wubatya natee ku nsukunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na milongoki myandi bu bedi dyanga, nkadyampemba wutula mayindu me yekola Yesu mu mutima wu Yuda Isikalyoti, mwana wu Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu wuzaba ti Tata wutula bimvimba mu moko mandi, ti ku Nzambi kafuma, mpe ti ku Nzambi kaavutuka. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Bu bedi dyanga, Yesu wutelama, wukatula kinkutu kyandi kiba ha yulu, wubonga mulele na wukanga wo mu luketo andi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ku manima, wubulumuna mamba mu ndonga yiyinene, wutona mu sukula malu ma milongoki myandi, na mu kusuna mo mu mulele wukakanga mu luketo. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Bu katuula ha Simoni Petelo, yandi wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, ngeye wunsukula meno malu e?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Wuna bakula ko mi nina hidika mu kilokola bekiki, kansi mbo wubakula ku mutwala.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Kaani, waansukula malu ko.» Yesu wuvutula ti: «Tala ti na kusukudi mo ko, waabwesa ba naani kintwadi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petelo wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, buna ka malu kaka ko, kansi na moko na mutu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu wubwesa ta dyaka ti: «Wonso muntu yobidi, kana nsatu ye bwesa yobila ko, tala ti ni mu sukula kaka malu ko, mu dyambu ti nitu andi yimvimba yi vedila yidi. Yeno bavedila ludi, kansi ka yeno bamvimba ko.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu wuzaba nani waamuyekola. Ni hahoho kateela ti: «Bamvimba ludyeno bavedila ko.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Bu kamana basukula malu, Yesu wulwata dyaka kinkutu kyandi, wuvutuka ha meza na wubateela ti: «Luna bakula misamu mi naluhidikidi e? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Luna ntumisina ti “Mulongisi” na “Mfumu”, kedika luna ta, mu dyambu ti Mulongisi na Mfumu nidi. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Tala ti meno nii Mulongisi na Mfumu nalusukudi bwabu malu, yeno mpe lufweti sukulanga malu yeno na yeno. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kadi kyo ni kifwani ki naluheeni, mwanki lusadila bonso bu sidi ku yeno. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kedika mu kedika naluteedidi, mundongo kahyokidi mfumu andi mfunu ko, mpe ntumwa kahyokidi muntu wumutambikidi mfunu ko. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Bu luzebi bwabu misamu bemyomyo, mu kyese lwaaba tala ti mya lwaasadila.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Nina zonzila mu yeno bamvimba ko, nzebi yobobo bana sodidi. Kansi masonama mafweti kwenda detila: “Yondowo wuna dya naani dimpa, wumbangumukini.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Naluteedidi myo bwabu tekila milutudila, mwanki bu myaalutudila, lukwikila ti “meno, nidi”. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kedika mu kedika naluteedidi, yondowo waatambula muntu wo wu nafidisa, meno katambula. Yondowo waantambula, tambudi yondowo wumfidisi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu zabikisi ti Yuda waamuyekola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu bu kamanisa mu zonza, mutima andi wuvizuka na wuta ti: «Kedika mu kedika naluteedidi, wumosi mu yeno waanyekola.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Milongoki mitalasana yawu na yawu na bazaba ko nani kedi zonzila. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Wumosi mu milongoki, yondowo Yesu wukedi tyanga, wuba wuzakala ha meza ha ntendo andi. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petelo wumulabikisa mwanki kafuula Yesu nani kana zonzila. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Mulongoki wubembama ha ntulu yi Yesu na wumufuula ti: Mfumu, nani wo e? <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Ni yondowo wu naahaana kibuku ki dimpa ki naavwanga mu ndonga.» Mboki, Yesu wuvwanga kyo na wuhaana kyo ku Yuda, mwana wu Simoni, mwisi-Isikalyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda bu katumbu bonga kibuku ki dimpa, Satana wukota mu yandi. Yesu wumuteela ti: «Myo mitiidi mu hidika, hidika myo munswalu!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ka muntu wumosi mu yobobo baba ha meza wubakula nki ka mu zonzila bobo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yuda bu kaba kikebi ki mbongo, milongoki mihiika myedi banza ti Yesu wumutuma kenda ka sumba bye hyokisila mukembo hoti wumuteela kenda kahaana bima ku bamputu. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda bu kabonga kibuku ki dimpa, wutumbu duuka ku mbazi. Mpimpa yiba.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musiku wumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda bu kaduuka ku mbazi, Yesu wuta ti: «Bwabu nkembo yi Mwana Muntu yi yenikini, mpe nkembo yi Nzambi yi yenikini mu yandi.» <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[ Tala ti Nzambi kemboso mu yandi,] Nzambi mpe mbo kamukembisa mu yandi, waamukembisa mu nswalu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Baala bani, mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi nakidi dyaka neeno. Mbo lunsosa, kansi bonso bu nateedi wo ku Bayudayo, mpe wa nina luteela bwabu yeno mpe: lulendi kwiza ku nina kwenda ko.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />«Musiku wumoona naluheeni: Zolasaneeno yeno na yeno bonso bu naluzodidi, yeno mpe zolasaneeno yeno na yeno. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Tala ti luna luzolo yeno na yeno, bantu mbo bazaba ti milongoki myani ludi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzabikisa ti Petelo waamubisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petelo wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, kwedi wuna kwenda e?» Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ku nina kwenda, kulendi ndanda ko bwabu. Kansi ntangu zina kwiza, waandanda.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, mu dyambu di nki ndendi kulanda mu kilokola bekiki ko e? Wukubama nidi mu haana luzingu lwani mu dyambu dyaku.» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Wukubama wudi mu haana luzingu lwaku mu dyambu dyani e? Kedika mu kedika nakuteedidi: tekila nsusu yikuba, waambisa nkumbu zitatu.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni nzila yikwe natanga ku Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu wuta ku milongoki myandi ti: «Mitima myeno mi vizukandi ko. Seeno kiminu mu Nzambi na seeno mpe kiminu mu meno. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Bibuka bibingi bii mu nzo yi Tata ani, nganunu naluteedidi ko ti nina kwenda mu lukubikila kibuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Bu naakwenda mu lukubikila kibuka, naavutuka, mpe naalubonga mu ba nani ha kimosi, mwanki ho ha nidi, yeno mpe luba hoho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Luzebi ku nina kwenda, mpe nzila ya luzebi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, tuzebi ku wuna kwenda ko. Bwedi twaazabila nzila e?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Meno nii nzila, kedika na luzingu. Kunani muntu lendi kwenda ku Tata tala ti kahyokidi ku meno ko. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Tala ti lunzebi, nganunu luzebi mpe Tata ani. Bwabu lumuzebi na lumuyeni.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipi wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, tulonka Tata na bufweni mu yeto.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Tuka ntama nii kintwadi neeno, Filipi, wunzebi ko e? Yondowo nyeni, yeni Tata. Bwedi lendi teela ti: “Tulonka Tata e?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Kwikidi ko ti meno nii mu Tata na Tata wuu mu meno e? Misamu mi nakwe luteelanga nkwe mye tanga mu lutumu lu meno bende ko. Ni Tata kwe zinganga mu meno, kwe salanga bisalu byandi. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nkwikileeno bu nina luteela ti: meno nii mu Tata, mpe Tata wuu mu meno. Tala ti kaani, kwikileeno kwandi mu bisalu bebibi. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, yondowo kwikidi mu meno, waasala bisalu bi nina sala. Mbo kasala dyaka bisalu bihyokidi kitezo, mu dyambu ti ku Tata nina kwenda. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Mpe kyonso-kyonso kima ki lwaalomba mu nkumbu ani, kyaanahidika, mwanki Tata ka kemboso mu Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Tala ti lundombidi kima mu nkumbu ani, kyaanahidika.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsilulu yi Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Tala ti luntiidi, Tumameeno mu Misiku myani. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Meno, naalomba ku Tata kaluhaana nsadisi yihiika yaaba neeno mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Mpeve yi kedika, yo nza kabisidi mu tambula, mu dyambu ti ka nayena yo ko na kazebi yo ko. Kansi yeno ya luzebi mu dyambu ti yikwe zinganga ha kati dyeno na yaaba mu yeno ntangu ka ntangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Naalusiisa bisaana ko, mbo navutuka ku yeno. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ntangu yifyoti kwandi yi siidi, nza yaabwesa nyena ko. Kansi yeno lwaanyena mu dyambu ti nii wumoyo mpe yeno mpe lwaaba bamoyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mu kilumbu bekyokyo, lwaabakula ti meno nii mu Tata ani, bonso yeno luu mu meno, mpe meno mu yeno.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Yondowo tambudi Misiku myani na sadidi myo, ni yandowo kwe ntyanga. Tata ani watya yondowo kwe ntyanga, meno mpe naamutya, mpe naazabakana ku yandi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, ka Yuda Isikalyoti ko, wumufuula ti: «Mfumu, bwedi waazabikinina ku yeto, kansi ka ku nza ko e?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Tala ti muntu wuntiidi, waasadila mambu mani na Tata ani waamutya. Twaakwiza ku yandi, mpe twaazakala ku yandi. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Muntu wulembolo ntya, kalendi keba mambu mani ko. Mambu bemama ma luna yuwa, ka mafumini mu meno ko, kansi ku Tata wumfidisa. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Naluteedidi myo bu nakidi neeno kintwadi. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Kansi nsadisi, Mpeve Yilongo yaatambika Tata mu nkumbu ani, yaalulongisa mimvimba na yaalubambula moyo mu mimvimba mi naluteedidi.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Nina lusisila kiyenge, nina luhaana kiyenge kyani. Meno nina luhaana kyo ka bonso nza yikwe haaninanga kyo ko. Ka luvizukandi mitima myeno ko na kaluyenandi bunkuta ko. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Luyuwa bu naluteela ti: “Nina kwenda, kansi mbo navutuka ku yeno.” Tala ti luntiidi, luketi ba bayangalala mu zaba ti ku Tata nina kwenda, mu dyambu ti Tata mpyokidi mfunu. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Naluzabikisi misamu bemimi tekila mituula, mwanki bu myatuula, lukwikila. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Naabwesa zonza dyaka bubwingi neeno ko, mu dyambu ti mfumu yi nza beyiyi yina kwiza. Kaa na lulendo mu meno ko. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Kansi nza yifweti zaba ti ntiidi Tata mpe nina sala bonso ntumunu yi kampana. Telameeno na tukatukeeno ehaha.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu muti wu vinu wukedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Meno nidi muti wu vinu wukedika, mboki Tata ani ni kisadi ki mfuba yi vinu. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kyonso kintala kii mu meno, kikwe lembolo butanga mbutu, kya kakwe zenganga. Mpe kyonso kintala kikwe butanga mbutu, kya kakwe kwangulanga mu ntendo, mwanki katoma buta mbutu zizingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Yeno lweka bwabu bavedila mu dyambu di mambu mana lusamunini. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Beeno bakangama mu meno, meno mpe mu yeno. Tala ti kintala kii kikangama mu muti wu vinu ko, kilendi buta mbutu kyabende ko. Bumosi mpe yeno tala ti luu bakangama mu meno ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Meno nii muti wu vinu, yeno ni bintala. Yondowo wuu wukangama mu meno bonso meno mu yandi, yandi waabuta mbutu zizingi. Mu dyambu ti lulendi sa kima ko tala ti luu mu meno ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Muntu wulembolo ba wukangama mu meno, watubu ku mbazi bonso kintala, mpe kyaayuma. Bakwe totanga bintala biyuma, mpe bya bakwe tubanga ku tiya, mboki bihidi. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Tala ti luu bakangama mu meno na mambu mani maa mu yeno, lombeeno kyonso kilutiidi, kyaalwabaka. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Tata ani waakemboso bonso ebu: ti lu butidi mbutu zizingi, mpe ti lweka nkatika milongoki myani. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Bonso Tata kantiidi, meno mpe nalutiidi. Beeno bakangama mu luzolo lwani. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Tala ti luna tumama mu Misiku myani, luu bakangama mu luzolo lwani, bonso bu nkwe tumamanga mu Misiku mi Tata ani mpe ni wukangama mu luzolo lwandi.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Naluteedidi bo, mwanki kyese kyani kiba mu yeno, mpe kyese kyeno kiba kilunga. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Musiku wani ni ewu: Zolasaneeno yeno na yeno bonso bu naluzodidi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kunani luzolo luhyokidi bunene tala ti ka mu hombisa luzingu lwandi mu dyambu di bakundi bandi ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Yeno bakundi bani ludi tala ti luna sadila mi nina lutuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nina lutumisina dyaka mindongo ko, mu dyambu ti mundongo kazebi mina hidika mfumu andi ko. Bakundi bani nina lutumisina, mu dyambu ti naluzabikisi mimvimba mi nayuwa ku Tata ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ka yeno ko lunsoola, kansi meno nalusoola, mpe naluheeni kiyeko mwanki lwenda lubuta mimbutu na mimbutu myeno mi zingila. Ni hahoho, kyonso kima ki lwaalomba ku Tata mu nkumbu ani, kyaakaluhaana <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ntumunu yi nina luhaana, ni mu zolasana yeno na yeno.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babela Yesu na milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Tala ti nza yina lubela, zabeeno ti yiteka mbela meno. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Tala ti bantu ba nza ludi, nganunu nza yilutya, mu dyambu ti luvwihulu ku nza. Tala ti nza yina lubela, ni mu dyambu ti luu bantu ba nza ko. Kansi meno nalusoola ha kati di bantu ba nza. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Bambukeno moyo misamu mi naluteela: “Mundongo kahyokidi mfumu andi mfunu ko.” Tala ti bankwamisi, mbo balukwamisa yeno mpe. Tala ti bakebidi mambu mani, mbo bakeba mameno mpe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Kansi baaluhidika mimvimba bemyomyo, mu dyambu dyani, mu dyambu ti bazebi yondowo wumfidisi ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Tala ti nayiza ko mpe na balonga mambu ko, nganunu baketi ba na masumu ko. Kansi bwabu basidi dyaka na ndemvokolo ko mu masumu mawu. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Muntu wuna mbela, wuna bela mpe Tata ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Tala ti nasala bisalu ha kati dyawu ko, byo byaka byasedi muntu wuhiika, nganunu baa na masumu ko. Bayeni bisalu byani, kansi bana mbela, meno na Tata ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Kansi mihilama mwanki mambu masonama mu buuku dyawu di Misiku menda detila: “Bambedidi wulembolo dyambu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Nsadisi bu kaakwiza, yondowo wu naalutambika mu nkumbu yi Tata, Mpeve yi kedika yi fumini ku Tata, yandi waanteela kimbangi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Yeno mpe mbo lunteela kimbangi, mu dyambu ti luu nani kintwadi tuka mbadukulu.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Naluteedidi misamu bemyomyo mwanki kiminu kyeno kilembolo zeza. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Mbo balukuma mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo, mpe bilumbu bina kwiza, yobobo baaluhonda babanzila ti bwabobo bu fwanakani mu sadila Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Baasadila bobo mu dyambu ti bazebi Tata ko na banzebi ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Kansi naluteedidi bobo mwanki ntangu bu yaafwana, lubambuka moyo ti waanaluteela. Naluteela wo ha ntonono ko mu dyambu ti naba neeno kintwadi.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nina kwenda bwabu ku yondowo wumfidisa, kansi kani muntu kana mfuula ko ti: “Kwedi wuna kwenda e?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Bwabu mitima myeno mifulukidi mu kyadi, bu naluteedidi bobo. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kedika nina luteela: bumbote ku yeno ti meno nenda, mu dyambu ti nalembolo kwenda, Nsadisi kaakwiza ku yeno ko. Kansi tala ti meno nenzi, mbo namufidisa. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Bu kaakwiza, mbo kalonka ku bantu ba nza beyiyi misamu mitadidi masumu, lunungu na mfundusu yi Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Mu myo mitadidi masumu, mu dyambu ti bakwikidi mu meno ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mu myo mitadidi lunungu, mu dyambu ti nina kwenda ku Tata, na luna nyena dyaka ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Mu myo mitadidi mfundusu yi Nzambi, mu dyambu ti mfumu yi nza beyiyi, meni fundusu bwabu.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Nii na misamu dyaka mimingi mye luteela, kansi lulendi mye vibidila ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Mpeve yi kedika bu yaakwiza, yaalutwadisa mu kedika kimvimba, mu dyambu ti yazonzila mu lutumu lu yandi bende ko, kansi mbo yazonzila mimvimba mi kaayuwa mpe mbo kalusamunina misamu myaakwiza ku ntwala. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yandi waankembisa mu dyambu ti waatambula ku meno mi kaalusamunina. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Bimvimba bii na Tata, byani mpe bidi. Ni hahoho ntedidi ti waatambula mimvimba mi myani, mpe waalusamunina myo.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyadi kyaakituka kyese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi, lwaabwesa nyena dyaka ko, mboki mwa ntangu yifyoti dyaka yisidi, mbo lubwesa nyena.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Mwa ndambu yi milongoki myandi myedi telasana yawu na yawu ti: «Nki katiidi mu tuteela e? Bu kana ta ti: “Mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi, lwaabwesa nyena dyaka ko, mboki mwa ntangu yifyoti dyaka yisidi, mbo lubwesa nyena.” Mpe dyaka ti: “Nenzi ku Tata.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Nkye mbangudulu yi misamu mi kateedi ti: “Mwa ntangu yifyoti yisidi dyaka e?” Tuna bakula ko nki katiidi mu ta.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu wubakula ti byuhu bana saka mu zika, ni kabateela ti: «Luna sosa mu zaba mbangudulu yi mpova yi nateedi ti: “Mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi, lwaabwesa nyena dyaka ko, mboki mwa ntangu yifyoti dyaka yisidi, mbo lubwesa nyena.”» <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Kedika mu kedika nina luteela, lwaadila na lwaaba mu manyongo, kansi nza yaayangalala. Mbo luba mu kyadi, kansi kyadi kyeno kyaakituka kyese. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mukento bu kakwe banga lukufi mu buta, weka mu kyadi mu dyambu ti ntangu andi ye yena mpasi yifweni. Kansi mwana bu wubutukidi, zimbakani mpasi zandi, mu dyambu ti weka mu kyese ki butukidi mwana. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Yeno mpe ntangu beyiyi lweka bwabu mu kyadi. Kansi bu twaayenana dyaka, mitima myeno myaangalala. Mpe kunaani muntu waalukatula kyese kyeno.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Kilumbu bekyokyo bu kyaatuula, lwaabwesa mfuula dyambu ko. Kedika mu kedika nina luteela wo, ni hahoho, kyonso kima ki lwaalomba ku Tata mu nkumbu ani, kyaakaluhaana. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Natee mu kilumbu bekiki, lwalombidi kani kima mu nkumbu ani ko. Lombeeno na lwaatambula, mpe kyese kyeno kyaaba ki lunga.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bedisi nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Mu bingana naluzonzidi misamu mimvimba bemyomyo. Mu bilumbu byaakwiza, nabwesa luzonzila mu bingana ko. kansi mu luzonzila misamu mi tadidi Tata, na bwesa lusweka dyambu ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mu kilumbu bekyokyo, mbo lulomba mu nkumbu ani, mpe naluteedidi ko ti mbo nalulombila ku Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Tata yandi bende wulutiidi, mu dyambu ti yeno luntiidi na lukwikidi ti ku Nzambi nafuma. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ku Tata nafuma mpe nayiza mu nza. Bwabu nina sisa nza, mpe nina vutuka kuu Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Milongoki myandi mi muteela ti: «Tala, bwabu mu tuzonzila wuna sweka dyambu ko, mpe wuna bwesa tuzonzila mu bingana ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Tuzebi bwabu ti ngeye zebi misamu mimvimba, mpe wuu nsatu ko ti muntu kakufuula. Tuzebi bwabu ti ngeye ku Nzambi wufuma.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bwabu lukwikidi e? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Tala, ntangu yeka lukufi, na yifweni bwabu yilwaamwangana kadi muntu na ndambu andi, mpe mbo lusala nsisa me kaka. Kansi, nii me kaka ko mu dyambu ti Tata wuu kintwadi nani. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Naluteedidi misamu bemyomyo, mwanki luba na kiyenge mu meno. Lwaayena mpasi mu nza. Kansi, lwateno kibakala, mu dyambu ti meno nabedisi nza.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lusambulu lu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu bu kamanisa mu zonza bobo, wusendola meso ku yulu na wuta ti: «Tata, kilokola kifweni. Kembisa Mwana aku mwanki Mwana mpe kakukembisa. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Wumuheeni lulendo mu bantu bamvimba, mwanki kahaana luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu ku yobobo bamvimba ba wumuhaana. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu ludi ti yawu ba kuzaba ti ngeye ni Nzambi yimosi kaka yi kedika, mpe mu zaba Yesu-Klisto, yondowo wu wutambikidi. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nakukembisi ha luse lu butoto, manisi kisalu ki wumpaana mu sala. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Bwabu, Tata nkembisa nge bende mu nkembo yi banani ha ntadisi aku tekila nza yi hilama. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Nazabikisi nkumbu aku ku bantu ba wumpaana, bawusoola mu nza. Baaba bantu baku, mpe ngeye wubampaana na batumamani mu mambu maku. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Bazebi bwabu ti bimvimba biwumpaana, ku ngeye bifuma, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />mu dyambu ti nabaheeni mambu ma wumpaana. Ni batambudi mo, bwabu nkatika bazebi ti ku ngeye nafuma, mpe bakwikidi ti ngeye wumfidisi.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Mu dyambu dyawu nina sambidila. Nina sambidila bantu ba nza ko, kansi yobobo bawumpeeni, mu dyambu ti bantu baaku badi. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Bima bimvimba bii bi byaku, bi byani bidi, mpe bimvimba bii bi byani, bi byaku bidi, mpe nina kemboso mu yawu. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Meno nsidi dyaka mu nza ko, Meno nina kwiza ku ngeye. Kansi yawu bana saala mu nza, Tata di Longo, bakeba mu nkumbu aku, nkumbu beyoyo yi wumpaana mwanki baba muntu wumosi bonso butudi naku. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Bu naba ha kimosi nawu, nedi bakebilanga mu nkumbu aku, yo yi wumpaana. Nabakebidi, mpe kani wumosi mu yawu kazimbadi ko, tala ti ka yondowo ko wufweti zimbala mwanki Masonama malunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Bwabu nina kwiza ku ngeye, mpe nina zonzila bobo bu nakidi mu nza, mwanki kyese kyani kiba mu yawu na kiba kilunga. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nabaheeni Mambu maku, kansi nza yibabedidi, mu dyambu ti badi bantu ba nza ko bonso meno nidi muntu wu nza ko. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nina kulomba ko ti wubakatula mu nza, kansi wubatanina ku Munga Mbi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Baa bantu ba nza ko bonso meno mpe nii muntu wu nza ko. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Babyeka mu kedika. Mambu maku maa kedika. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Bonso bu wumfidisi mu nza, meno mpe nabafidisi mu nza, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nakiyekodi mvimba ku ngeye mu dyambu dyawu, mwanki yawu mpe baba babyeko mu kedika.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Nina sambila mu dyambu dyawu kaka ko, kansi mu dyambu di yobobo mpe baakwikila mu meno, mu mambu mawu. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nina sambila mwanki bamvimba baba wumosi, bonso ngeye Tata wuu mu meno, mpe meno mu ngeye. Bika yawu mpe baba wumosi mu yeto, mwanki nza yikwikila ti ngeye wumfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nabaheeni nkembo yi wumpaana mwanki baba muntu wumosi bonso butudi muntu wumosi ngeye na meno, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />meno mu yawu, ngeye mu meno, mwanki baba nkatika muntu wumosi, mpe nza yibakula ti ngeye wumfidisi, na wubatiidi bonso buntiidi.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Tata, ntiidi ti ho ha nidi, bantu ba wumpaana baba kintwadi nani, mwanki bayena nkembo ani, nkembo yi wumpaana mu luzolo lwaku mu meno tekila nza yihilama. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tata nkwa lunungu, nza yikuzaba ko, kansi meno nakuzaba, mpe yababa babakudi ti ngeye wumfidisi. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nabazabikisi nkumbu aku, mpe naatatamana mu bazabikisa yo, mwanki luzolo lwaku mu meno, luba mu yawu, bonso meno mu yawu.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bakengi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu bu kamanisa mu sambila, wuyenda na milongoki myandi ku simu dihiika di nto yi Sedeloni. Mfuba yi miti yiba koko, mpe wukota mu mfuba beyoyo na milongoki myandi. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda wedi muyekola wuzaba kibuka bekyokyo, mu dyambu ti Yesu na milongoki myandi baba na kifu kye kwe kutakananga koko. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuda wuyenda koko, mpe wunata kamba di zimbulu-mbulu na minkengi mi muhaana mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na Bafalisi. Yawu baba na binwanunu, na bisisi bi tiya, mpe na minda. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu wuzaba misamu mimvimba myedi mutuudila, wufinama ku yawu na wubafuula ti: «Nani luna sosa e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bavutula ti: «Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti.» Yesu wubateela ti: «Ni Meno.» Yuda wedi mu yekola, wuba ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu bu katumbu bateela ti: «Ni Meno», bavutukisa ku manima na babwa ha nsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu wubwesa bafuula ti: «Nani luna sosa e?» Bavutula dyaka ti: «Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu wubwesa bavutudila ti: «Ni meno naluteedidi. Tala ti ni meno luna sosa buna bikeno yababa benda kwawu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Bwabobo misamu mi kata miyenda detila: «Meno nzimbisi kani wumosi mu yobobo bawumpaana ko.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petelo wuba na mbele yi mvita, wuduukisa yo mu lukutu, na wukata kisadi ki mfumu yi nganga-Nzambi, na wumuzenga kutu dimimbakala. Kisadi bekyokyo nkumbu andi Malikuse. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Kansi, Yesu wuteela Petelo ti: «Vutula mbele aku mu lukutu lwandi. Wuna banza ti mbo nabisa mu nwa mbungu yi yimpasi yimpeni Tata ani mu nwa e?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kabu di zimbulu-mbulu, ha kimosi na mfumu awu, na minkengi mi zimfumu zi Bayudayo, babwila Yesu na bamubindika misinga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bateka munata ku Ana buko bu Kayifa. Kayifa wuba mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi mu mumvu bewowo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ni Kayifa wulwengisa mfumu zi Bayudayo bu kata ti: «Luna yena ko ti bulutidi bumbote muntu wumosi ka fwa mu dyambu di mukangu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wuta ti kadi mulongoki wu Yesu ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mlk 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petelo na mulongoki wuhiika balanda Yesu. Mulongoki bewowo wuhiika, wuba wuzabakana ku mfumu zinganga-Nzambi, buna wukota ha kimosi na Yesu ha mbazi yi lupangu ku kati di nzo yi mfumu zinganga-Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Kansi Petelo wusala ha mbazi bela-bela na mwelo. Mulongoki wuhiika, yondowo wuba wuzabakana ku mfumu zinganga-Nzambi, wuduuka ha mbazi na wuzonza na mukento wedi kebanga mwelo, mboki wukotisa Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Kisadi kyedi kebanga mwelo ki muteela ti: «Ngeye mpe wudi wumosi mu milongoki mi muntu bewuwu ko e?» Petelo wuvutula ti: «Kaani, nii mulongoki andi ko!»<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kyozi kikingi kiba, ni hahoho bisadi na minkengi bazungidila tiya tu makala tu banamika mu yetila. Petelo mpe wuba nawu kintwadi na wedi yetila nawu tiya.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfumu nganga-Nzambi vwikidi Yesu byuhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi wuvwika Yesu byuhu mu myo mitadidi milongoki myandi na ndongosolo andi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Meno ha meso ma bantu bamvimba nabe zonzila. Meno nabe longa mu nzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo na mu nzo-Nzambi mu kwe kutakananga Bayudayo bamvimba, nateedi kani dyambu mu mansweki ko. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Nki wuna mvwikila kyuhu e? Mina zonzidi, fuula ku yobobo babe nyuwa. Yawu bazebi mi nateedi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Mu mpova bezozo, wumosi mu minkengi wuba hoho, wukaata Yesu mbata, na wuta ti: «Ngeye bobobo wuna haanina mvutu ku mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Tala ti bumbi nazonzidi, nteela dyambu dimbi di nateedi. Tala ti bumbote nazonzidi, bila nki wunkaatidi mbata e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Buna Ana wumutambika wubinduku mu misinga ku Kayifa mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wubisa dyaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mlk 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Petelo wuba hoho na wedi yetila tiya. Bamuteela ti: «Ngeye mpe wuu wumosi mu milongoki myandi ko e?» Petelo wubisa na wuta ti: «Kaani, kameno ko!» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Wumosi mu bisadi bi mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi, wu ba kanda dimosi na yondowo Petelo wu kazenga kutu, wumuteela ti: «Ka ngeye ko nayeningi ku mfuba nandi e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Kansi Petelo wubisa kwandi dyaka. Mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi, nsusu yikuba.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Mene na mene, baduuka ku nzo yi Kayifa, na banata Yesu ku nzo yi kisalu yi munyadi, mwisi-Loma. Bayudayo bakota mu kati ko, mwanki balembolo sumuka, mpe badya bindya bi Pake. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilatu wuduuka mu babwana na wubateela ti: «Nkye musamu luna fundila muntu bewuwu e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Tala ti muntu bewuwu kakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi ko, nganunu twizidi muyekola mu moko maku ko.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Buna Pilatu wubavutudila ti: «Mubongeeno yeno bende na mufundiseeno bonso buu Misiku myeno.» Mfumu zi Bayudayo bamuteela ti: «Yeto tuu na luve mu zengila muntu lufwa ko.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Bwabobo misamu mi ta Yesu miyenda detila bu kazabikisa nkye mfwilu kaafwila. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilatu wukota dyaka mu kati di nzo andi yi kisalu. Wutumisa Yesu na wumufuula ti: «Ngeye ni ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Bwedi, ku nsye mutima aku wufumini hoti bantu bahiika ba kuteedidi wo mu nitu ani e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu wumuvutudila ti: «Kadi meno Muyudayo nidi e? Bisi nsi aku na mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi bakuyekodi ku meno. Nkye musamu sidi e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Kintinu kyani kidi ki nza beyiyi ko. Tala ti kintinu kyani ki nza beyiyi kidi, bisadi byani biketi nwanina mwanki nalembolo yekolo mu moko ma zimfumu zi Bayudayo. Kansi kintinu kyani kii ki nza beyiyi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilatu wumuteela bwabu ti: «Ngeye ntinu wudi e?» Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye wuna ta wo ti meno ntinu nidi. Meno nabutuka, mpe nayiza mu nza mu teela kedika kimbangi. Wonso muntu wuu mu kedika, kwe yuwanga ndinga ani.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu wumufuula ti: «Kedika ni nki e?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu bamuzengidi lufwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mlk 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilatu bu kamana ta bobo, wuduuka dyaka ku mbazi kuba Bayudayo na wubateela ti: «Meno mbeki kibila kye muzengila lufwa ko. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Kansi bonso budi kifu kyeno, konso mukembo wu Pake, nkwe luyambudilanga nkole yimosi. Bwabu lutiidi na luyambudila ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Buna balookana ti: «Kaani, ka yandi ko, kansi Balabase.» Nkyongono Balabase kinkita kwandi kiba.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Pilatu wuhaana lutumu banata Yesu na ba muzuba bikoti. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />zimbulu-mbulu zihidika mpu yi nsende yi kintinu, ni batuula yo ha yulu mutu andi, mpe zimulwika kiyunga kimbwaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Mboki bedi finamanga ha ntadisi andi na bedi tanga ti: «Mbote aku, ntinu yi Bayudayo.» Ni bedi mu katanga zimbata.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu wuduuka dyaka na wubateela ti: «Yuweno, yandi nina lutwadila ku mbazi, mwanki luzaba ti na mubeki kibila kye muzengila lufwa ko.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Buna Yesu wuduuka ku mbazi, wuba wulwata mpu yi nsende na kiyunga kimbwaki. Pilatu wubateela ti: «Muntu bende ewu!»<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Kansi mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na minkengi bu batumbu muyena, balokana ti: «Mukoma ha kulunsi, mukoma ha kulunsi!» Pilatu wubwesa ta ti: «Mubongeeno na mukomeeno ha kulunsi yeno bende, mu dyambu ti mu meno, mbeki kibila kye muzengila lufwa ko.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bayudayo bamuvutudila ti: «Musiku wuu neto. Musiku bewowo wuna ta ti yandi fweti fwa, mu dyambu ti wukiteedi ti yandi Mwana wu Nzambi kadi.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu bu kayuwa misamu bemyomyo, wubwesa yena dyaka bunkuta. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Wukota dyaka mu kati di nzo andi yi kisalu na wufuula Yesu ti: «Ngeye mwisi-kwedi wudi e?» Kansi Yesu kamuvutudila mvutu ko. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilatu ni kamuteela bwabu ti: «Wuna mpeeka mvutu ko e? Zebi ko ti meno nii na lutumu lwe kuyambula na lwe ku komoso ha kulunsi e?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kulendi ba na lutumu mu meno ko tala ti Nzambi kakuheeni lo ko. Ni hahoho, yondowo nyekodi ku ngeye, hodidi masumu ma hyokidi bunene.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Tuka ntangu beyoyo, Pilatu wusosa nzila ye muyambula. Kansi mfumu zi Bayudayo batona mu lokana ti: «Wumana muyambula, wuu nkayi yi Kayisali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kayisali: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nkumbu yi kintinu ku muntu wuna toma nsi yi Loma </char></note> ko. Mu dyambu ti wonso muntu wuna kilonka ti yandi ntinu kadi, weka mbeni yi Kayisali.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bu kayuwa misamu bemyomyo, Pilatu wuduukisa Yesu ku mbazi, mpe wuyenda zakala ha kyandu ki lufundusu, ha kibuka ki bakwe tumisinanga ti kyanzala ki matadi, mu ndinga yi ki-Ebeleo ti Ngabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Kiba kilumbu ki bedi kubikanga mukembo wu Pake, kampe yiba bela-bela na ntangu ha mbata. Pilatu wuta ku Bayudayo ti: «Ntinu eno eyi!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Kansi balookana ti: «Muhonda! Muhonda! Mukoma ha kulunsi!» Pilatu wubwesa ta ti: «Nakoma ntinu eno ha kulunsi e?» Mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi zivutula ti: «Ntinu yimosi kwandi yii neto ni Kayisali.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Buna wubayekodila Yesu mwanki baamukoma ha kulunsi. Babonga Yesu mpe bamunata.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakoma Yesu ha kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Bu kananguna kulunsi dyandi, wuduuka mu mbanza mu kwenda ha kibuka ki bakwe tumisinanga ti: «Kikonzongolo ki mutu», mu ndinga yi ki-Ebeleo, Ngolongota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Hahoho bakomina Yesu ha kulunsi ha kimosi na bantu bole bahiika, wumosi ku lubakala na wuhiika ku lumoso, Yesu ha kati-kati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu wusonika mu kibuku ki baya, kikaledika ha yulu kulunsi, bisono bita ti: «Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, ntinu yi Bayudayo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayudayo babingi batanga bisono bebyobyo, mu dyambu ti kibuka ki bakomina Yesu kiba bela-bela na mbanza, na bisono biba bisonoko mu ndinga yi ki-Ebeleo, yi ki Latini na yi Kingeleke. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi zi Bayudayo ziteela Pilatu ti: «Kusonikandi ti: “Ntinu yi Bayudayo”, kansi: “Muntu bewuwu wuta ti: Meno nii ntinu yi Bayudayo”.» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu wuvutula ti: «Minsonikini, mimeni sonama.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Zimbulu-mbulu bu zimana koma Yesu ha kulunsi, zibonga binkutu byandi, ni zikabana byo mu ndambu ziya, kadi mbulu-mbulu na ndambu andi. Zibonga mpe zwele dyandi, diba mu mulele wumosi wulembolo tungu, kutonina ku yulu natee ku nsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Zimbulu-mbulu ziteelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Tukakunandi kinkutu bekiki ko, kansi tubudileeno kyo hwadi mu zaba nani waabaka kyo.» Mwanki Masonama menda detila:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Zikabani binkutu byani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">na zibudidi zwele dyani hwadi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Bwabobo bu sa zimbulu-mbulu.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ngudi andi, mpangi yi ngudi andi yi mukento, Maliya mukento wu Kolopase na Maliya mwisi-Mangadala baba batelama ha kulunsi di Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu bu kayena ngudi andi ha ntendo mulongoki wu kedi toma tyanga, wuteela ngudi andi ti: «Mama, ewu ni mwana aku.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Mboki wuta ku mulongoki bewowo ti: «Ewu ni ngudi aku.» Tuka kilokola bekyokyo, mulongoki wumutambula ku nzo andi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu bu kazaba ti mimvimba milungidi, mwanki Masonama menda detila, wuta ti: «Nsatu mamba yi nani.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Huma behoho ha ba na kisiku kiba kiteboka mu vinu dinsa. Zimbulu-mbulu zibonga musakasaka, zikanga wo ha nsongi yi kintala ki muti wu isopi, zivwanga wo mu vinu dinsa, mboki zituula wo ha munwa wu Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu bu kamana nwa vinu dinsa, wuta ti: «Mimvimba milungidi.» Bu kayinika mutu, ni kafwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batobodi Yesu lubanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kiba kilumbu ki bedi kubikanga mukembo wu Pake. Mfumu zi Bayudayo batya ko ti mvumbi ziba ha kulunsi natee kilumbu ki saba, mu dyambu ti kilumbu ki saba bekyokyo kiba nkatika kilumbu ki kinene. Ni hahoho, bayenda lomba ku Pilatu luve lwe bokola malu ma bantu ba bakoma, mpe lwe bakatula ha kulunsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Zimbulu-mbulu ziyenda mpe zibokola malu ma muntu wuntete, mboki wunzole mu yobobo bakomo ha kulunsi ha kimosi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Bu zituula ha Yesu, ziyena ti wukifwila kwandi, ni hahoho zilembolo mubokodila malu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Kansi wumosi mu zimbulu-mbulu wumutobola lubanzi mu dyonga, mpe menga na mamba maduuka. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Yondowo wuyena myo, wuna ta kimbangi. Kimbangi kyandi kikedika kidi. Mpe zebi ti kedika kana ta, mwanki yeno mpe lukwikila. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Kansi mimvimba bemimi mihilama, mwanki Masonama menda detila: «Bamubokola kani kihisi kimosi ko.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Masonama mateedi dyaka ti: «Baasikika meso mawu ku yondowo wu batobodi lubanzi.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batuula nitu yi Yesu mu ndyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:51-61">Mat 27.51-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, Yosefi mwisi-Alimate, wuba mulongoki wu Yesu mu mansweki, mu dyambu di bunkuta bu zimfumu zi Bayudayo. Wuyenda lomba Pilatu luve lwe bonga nitu yi Yesu. Pilatu wumuhaana luve, mpe Yosefi wuyenda bonga nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemo, mu ntama, wuyenda tala Yesu mu kati-kati di mpimpa, wuyiza mpe. Wunata mananasi, makumatatu ma zikilo, ma bahidikila mu mile na alowese. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Yosefi na Nikodemo babonga nitu yi Yesu na bazinga yo bitende bi lino, batula yo mananasi, bonso buu kifu ki Bayudayo bu bakwe zika zimvumbi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ha kibuka ki bakomina Yesu ha kulunsi, haba na mfuba yi miti. Mpe mu mfuba beyoyo mu ba na ndyamu yimosi yi batimuna mu tadi, yilembolo teka zikulu muntu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ni mwamomo batuula Yesu, mu dyambu ti yiba nkubukulu yi mukembo wu Pake yi Bayudayo, mpe ndyamu yiba bela-bela.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ndyamu yimpamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Kilumbu ki lumingu mu minkyelo mi bwisi, mwa mpimpa buna yakidi, Maliya mwisi-Mangadala wuyenda ku ndyamu. Wuyena ti tadi dikwe kanganga mwelo wunkotolo wu ndyamu, dyabakatudi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Wuyenda mu muswalu ku Simoni na mulongoki wuhiika, yondowo Yesu wukedi tyanga, na wubateela ti: «Mfumu yandi bakatudi mu ndyamu, na tuzebi ko kwedi bamutudidi.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petelo na mulongoki wuhiika, baduuka mu nzo na bayenda ku ndyamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Banooka ntinu yababole, kansi mulongoki wuhiika wuvudila Petelo ntinu na wutuula wuntete ku ndyamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Wukondama mu tadidila na wuyena bitende bi lino biba bituulu hoho, kansi kakota ko. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petelo wedi kwe mulandi, wutuula yandi mpe na wukota mu ndyamu. Wuyena bitende bi lino biba hoho, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na mulele wu bazinga mutu wu Yesu. Mulele bewowo wuba kibuka kimosi ko na bitende bi lino. Kansi wuba wufutuku ha nsoso, ha kibuka kihiika. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, mulongoki wuhiika, yondowo wutuula wuntete ku ndyamu, wukota yandi mpe. Wuyena na wukwikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Mu dyambu ti milongoki mibakula ntete ko Masonama mata ti: «Yesu fweti fuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Mboki milongoki mivutuka ku nzo awu.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyenikina Maliya mwisi-Mangadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mlk 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliya wuba wutelama ku mbazi, ha ntendo mwelo wu ndyamu. Bu kedi dila, ni kakondama mu tadidila mu kati di ndyamu, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />wuyena mbazi zi Nzambi zole zilwaata binkutu biba na veko-veko, zi zakala ha kibuka kiba nitu yi Yesu. Wumosi wuba kubela mutu, wuhiika kubela malu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Zimbazi zi Nzambi zimufuula ti «Mama, nki wuna didila e?» Wubavutudila ti: «Nitu yi Mfumu ani ya babongidi, na nzebi ko kwedi benzi mu tuula.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza bobo, wubaluka, wuyena Yesu wuba wutelama hoho. Kansi kedi bakula ko ti ni yandi. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mama, nki wuna didila e? Nani wuna sosa e?» Kedi banzila ti yandi kisadi ki mfuba yi miti, ni kamuteela ti: «Tala ti ngeye wu mubongidi, nteela kwedi wenzi mutuula. Mwanki nenda namubonga.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Maliya.» Maliya wubaluka na wuta mu ndinga yi ki-Ebeleo ti: «Labuni!» Mbangudulu ti: «Mulongisi!» <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Kunsimbandi ko, mu dyambu ti natombokidi ku Tata ani ko. Kansi yenda ku zimpangi zani na bateela ti “Nina tomboka ku Tata ani wuu mpe Tata eno, ku Nzambi ani wuu mpe Nzambi eno.”» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Maliya mwisi-Mangadala wuyenda ku milongoki na wubazabikisa ti: «Mfumu yandi nyeni.» Ni kabayadila mpolo mu mimvimba mi kamuteela.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yenikini ku milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Mu nkokila beyoyo kwandi yi kilumbu bekyokyo kilumingu, myelo mi nzo yiba milongoki miba mitoma kangama, mu dyambu ti baba na bunkuta bu zimfumu zi Bayudayo. Yesu wuyiza, wutelama ha kati-kati dyawu na wuta ti: «Kiyenge kyeno.» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza bobo, wubalonka moko mandi na lubanzi lwandi. Milongoki baba mu kyese kikingi bu bayena Mfumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Kiyenge kyeno. Bonso Tata kantambika, meno mpe nina lutambika.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza, wufuula mupepe mu yawu na wubateela ti: «Tambuleeno Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Yobobo ba lwaalemvokila masumu, baatambula mulemvo. Yobobo ba lwaalembolo lemvokila masumu, baatambula mulemvo ko.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Toma, wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole, yondowo wu bakwe tumisinanga «Nsimba», kaba nawu kintwadi ko mu ntangu Yesu bu kayiza. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Milongoki mihiika mi muyadila ti: «Yeto Mfumu yandi tuyeni.» Kansi wubavutudila ti: «Tala ti nyeni mu moko mandi bifu bi nsonso ko, tala ti ntudidi mulembo ani ha kifu ki nsonso na kooko kwani ha lubanzi lwandi ko, naakwikila ko.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Kisabala kimosi kihyoka, milongoki mi Yesu mi kutakana dyaka mu nzo, Toma wuba nawu kintwadi. Mpeleko myelo mimvimba miba mitoma kangama, Yesu wuyiza wutelama ha kati-kati dyawu na wuta ti: «Kiyenge kyeno.» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Mboki wuteela Toma ti: «Yiza tuula mulembo aku eha, na tala moko mani. Lambula kooko kwaku na tuula ko mu lubanzi lwani. Bika maketiketi maku, kansi kwikila.» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma wumuvutudila ti: «Mfumu ani na Nzambi ani.» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bunyeni, hahoho kwikidi e? Kyese ku yobobo balembolo yena, kansi bakwikidi.»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfunu yi buuku bedidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu wusa dyaka bimangu bibingi ha ntadisi yi milongoki myandi, bilembolo ba bisonama mu buuku bedidi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Kansi mii misonama, mwanki lukwikila ti Yesu ni Klisto, Mwana wu Nzambi. Bu lwakwikila, mbo lubaka moyo mu yandi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki nsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mwa bilumbu bi hyoka, Yesu wuyenika dyaka ku milongoki myandi ha kumu di dyanga di Tibelyade. Tala bwedi kayenikina: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petelo, Toma wu bakwe tumisinanga ti «Nsimba», Natanayeli mwisi-Kaana mu kizunga ki Ngalili, baala ba Zebedayi na milongoki myole mihiika mi Yesu miba ha kimosi nawu. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petelo wubateela ti: «Nenzi ku loba.» Bamuvutudila ti: «Yeto mpe twaakwenda naku.» Bayenda na bamaka mu mulungu. Kansi mpimpa beyoyo, babaka kima ko.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Bwisi bu bukya, Yesu wuba wutelama ha kumu di mamba. Kansi milongoki myedi zaba ko ti yandi wuba. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Ee baala, luu na kima nkye dyaka ko e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Kaani». <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Wubateela ti: «Looseeno mpwasa ku sambu di mimbakala di mulungu na mbo lubaka.» Balosa mpwasa, ni bedi lembakana mu kotisa yo mu mulungu, mu dyambu ti mbizi zingi ziba. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Mulongoki wedi tyanga Yesu, ni kateela Petelo ti: «Mfumu wudi!» Simoni Petelo bu kayuwa ti Mfumu wudi, wulwata dyaka mulele, mu dyambu ti kaba wulwata ko, mboki ni kabwa mu mamba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Milongoki mi sala myedi kwe nati mulungu ku kumu mpe myedi kwe naningi mpwasa yiba yifuluka mu mbizi: baba dyaka kitatu na kumu ko, kampe zimetele nkama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bu bakulumuka ha nsi, bayena tiya tu makala, mbizi zi tentoko hoho na dimpa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Nateeno mwa ndambu mbizi zi lubeki.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petelo wumaka dyaka mu mulungu na wutunta mpwasa natee ha butoto, yiba yi fuluka mu nkama na makumatanu na tatu di zimbizi zizinene. Mpeleko mbizi zi hyoka kitezo, kansi mpwasa yikakuka ko.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Yizeno ludya.» Na kaani mulongoki wumosi wulenda mu mufuula ti: «Ngeye ni nani e?» Mu dyambu ti batoma zaba ti Mfumu wudi. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu wuyenda ba bela-bela nawu. wubonga dimpa na wuba haana dyo. Wusa bumosi mpe mu mbizi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yo ni nkumbu yi tatu Yesu yi kayenika ku milongoki tuka mfulukulu andi mu bafwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bu bamanisa mu dya, Yesu wuteela Simoni Petelo ti: «Simoni, mwana wu Yoane, kadi wuntiidi kuhyoka ebaba e?» Wuvutula ti: «Ninga Mfumu, zebi ti nakutiidi.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Keba baala ba mameme mani.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nkumbu yinzole, Yesu wumuteela ti: «Simoni, mwana wu Yoane, kadi wuntiidi e?» Wumuvutudila ti: «Ninga Mfumu, zebi ti nakutiidi.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Ba mumvungi wu mameme mani.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Mu nkumbu yitatu wumufuula ti: «Simoni, mwana wu Yoane, kadi wuntiidi e?» Petelo wukota mu kyadi mu dyambu ti Yesu wumufuula mu nkumbu yitatu ti: «Kadi wuntiidi e?» Na wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, ngeye zebi mimvimba, nkatika zebi ti nakutiidi.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Keba mameme mani. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kedika mu kedika nina kuteela, bu wuba ntwenya, nge bende wedi kanganga melika aku mpe wedi kwendanga konso kutiidi. Kansi, bu waaba kinunu, waalambula moko, mpe muntu wuhiika waakukanga melika, na waakunata kuma kulembolo tya mu kwenda.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu wuzonzila bobo mu lonka bwedi Petelo kaafwila na kaakembisila Nzambi. Bu kamanisa mu zonza, wumuteela ti: «Ndanda.»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mulongoki wu kedi tyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petelo bu kasyetoka, wuyena mulongoki, Yesu wu kedi tyanga wedi kwiza ku manima awu, yondowo wu ba wubembama ha ntulu andi mu ntangu yi bedi dya, wuta ti: «Mfumu, nani wo waakuyekola e?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Bu kamuyena, Petelo wufuula Yesu ti: «Mfumu, ha mbo yandi, nki byaamutudila e?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Tala ti ntiidi ti kazinga natee bu navutuka, kadi nge miteedi e? Ngeye, ndanda.» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Musamu wu mwangana ha kati di zimpangi ti mulongoki bewuwu kaafwa ko. Mpeleko, Yesu kateela Petelo ko ti: «Kaafwa ko.» Kansi, ebu kata ti: «Tala ti ntiidi ti kazinga natee bu navutuka, kadi nge miteedi e?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ni mulongoki bewowo wu nata kimbangi ki misamu bemyomyo na wusonika myo, mpe tuzebi ti kimbangi kyandi kikedika kidi.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misamu mihiika mi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu wuhidika dyaka misamu mimingi mihiika. Tala ti ni basonika myo wumosi-wumosi, nganunu nza yimvimba yiketi baka kibuka kye lundila mabuuku mamvimba bemomo ko.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>